local _, GQ = ...

-- Quest story paragraphs, keyed by the exact English paragraph.
if GQ.ActiveLocale ~= "zhCN" then
    return
end

local text = GQ.LocaleText
for k, v in pairs({
    ["Garrick Padfoot - a cutthroat who's plagued our farmers and merchants for weeks - was seen at a shack near the vineyards, which lies east of the Abbey and across the bridge."] = "加里克·帕德福特是个亡命之徒，几个星期来一直骚扰我们的农民和商人。有人在葡萄园附近的一间棚屋里见过他，那里在修道院以东，过了桥就是。",
    ["Nothing like a day of boar hunting, eh? Though, here in Coldridge Valley, there are so many boars it almost takes the fun out of it. No need to get them charging."] = "没有什么比打一天野猪更痛快的了，对吧？不过在这冰冷山谷里，野猪多得简直都没意思了。根本不用去引它们冲锋。",
    ["I hate those nasty timber wolves! But I sure like eating wolf steaks... Bring me tough wolf meat and I will exchange it for something you'll find useful."] = "我讨厌那些可恶的森林狼！不过我倒是很爱吃狼排……给我带些坚韧的狼肉来，我会拿点对你有用的东西跟你交换。",
    ["You look as though you might need something to keep your hands warm, hm? I'll tell you what would help: a pair of nice, warm gloves."] = "你看起来像是需要点东西来暖手，嗯？我告诉你什么管用：一副暖和的好手套。",
    ["Hildelve wrote in his journal that he was attacked by Mangeclaw, a \"huge Ice Claw Bear.\" He drove off the beast, but not before it mauled him savagely."] = "希尔德尔夫在日记里写道，他遭到了“巨大的冰爪熊”烂爪的袭击。他赶跑了那头野兽，但在那之前已被它残忍地撕咬重伤。",
    ["The Brackwells have a prize-winning pig, Princess. The sow is HUGE, and she got that way from sneaking over here and eating my veggies! So before she comes to our fields...Princess must die!"] = "布拉克威尔家有一头得过奖的猪，名叫公主。这头母猪大得吓人，都是因为它偷偷溜到这边吃我的蔬菜才长成那样的！所以在它跑到我们的田里之前……公主必须死！",
    ["I was playing near the Fargodeep Mine, and I think I dropped, er...I mean I saw, the old lady's necklace. Don't ask me how it got there...it wasn't me!"] = "我在法戈深矿洞附近玩的时候，好像弄丢了……呃……我是说我看见了那位老太太的项链。别问我它怎么会在那儿……不是我干的！",
    ["We believe they are hiding out in the Dagger Hills, plotting their next move. Slay the wretches in the name of The People's Militia."] = "我们相信他们藏在匕首岭，策划着下一步行动。以人民民兵团的名义，杀光这些恶棍。",
    ["Look at what has happened to this place! These lands were once occupied by good farm folk. But the damned thieves have driven them all off. Not me, though!"] = "看看这个地方变成什么样了！这片土地曾经住着善良的农民。可是该死的盗贼把他们全赶跑了。不过我可没被赶走！",
    ["Your previous investigations are proof that the Echo Ridge Mine needs purging. Return to the mine and help clear it of kobolds. Waste no time."] = "你先前的调查证明回声山矿洞需要清理。回到矿洞去，帮忙清除里面的狗头人。别浪费时间。",
    ["For your shrewdness and valor, I have a marker here that is good for one piece of armor. I want you to take it to Sara Timberlain at the Eastvale Logging Camp."] = "为了奖励你的机智和勇敢，我这儿有一张凭证，可以换一件护甲。我要你把它交给东谷伐木场的萨拉·蒂姆伯莱恩。",
    ["I must warn you, this matter must stay between us. The satyr are enough of an embarrassment to us already, and this one is much too close to home."] = "我必须警告你，这件事只能留在我们之间。萨特已经让我们够丢脸的了，而这一件离我们实在太近了。",
    ["We heard the cries in the middle of the night. Then this morning, sure enough, the herd was missing two rams. That dastardly beast known as Vagash has been preying on our livelihood."] = "我们半夜听到了惨叫。今天早上，果然，羊群里少了两只公羊。那头名叫瓦加什的卑鄙野兽一直在掠夺我们的生计。",
    ["I'm on a quest, a quest to make the perfect stout. I know I can do it -- brewing's in my blood. I just need to find the right recipe... The Frostmane trolls grow a plant, shimmerweed, high up in the hills to the east."] = "我正在追求一个目标，酿出完美的烈性黑啤。我知道我能做到——酿酒就在我的血液里。我只需要找到合适的配方……霜鬃巨魔在东边山丘高处种了一种植物，叫闪光草。",
    ["Upon further analysis of the Gnomeregan situation, it would appear as though we not only failed to eradicate the troggs but we also happened to turn most of the gnomish race into horrific, mindless, evil-doing leper gnomes."] = "进一步分析诺莫瑞根的情况后，看来我们不但没能消灭穴居人，还把大部分侏儒变成了可怕的、没有头脑的、作恶多端的麻风侏儒。",
    ["The Silver Stream Mine to the east ran dry long ago. It was converted by the Miners' League into a storage depot, but now Kobolds have moved in, putting their filthy paws on good, Dwarven tools!"] = "东边的银溪矿洞早就干涸了。矿工联盟把它改成了仓库，但现在狗头人搬了进来，把脏爪子伸向了好好的矮人工具！",
    ["One of our greatest struggles is obtaining the natural resources we need to survive. Gold was scarce even in the height of the Alliance's power."] = "我们最大的难题之一，就是获取生存所需的自然资源。即使在联盟最强盛的时候，黄金也很稀缺。",
    ["Executor Zygand tells me you've been out killing Scarlet Crusaders. Tirisfal Glades is crawling with them."] = "执行者扎伊甘德告诉我，你一直在外面杀血色十字军。提瑞斯法林地到处都是他们。",
    ["The Mass Graves, southwest of Garren's Haunt to the north, were made to accommodate the...impressive...number of deaths Tirisfal suffered when the Plague first came."] = "北边加伦鬼屋西南面的乱葬岗，是为了容纳瘟疫刚爆发时提瑞斯法所遭受的……数量……惊人的死亡而建的。",
    ["The Agamand Mills area has become a foothold for the Scourge. Their strongest point is the Agamand Family Crypt where their local military leader, a skeleton named Captain Dargol, has headquartered."] = "阿加曼德磨坊一带已成为天灾军团的立足点。他们最强的据点是阿加曼德家族墓穴，他们当地的军事首领，一个名叫达戈尔上尉的骷髅，把总部设在那里。",
    ["Wanted: Maggot Eye! A foul beast, even by Gnoll standards, Maggot Eye has been sentenced to death for his crimes against The Forsaken. This despicable villain has been stealing corpses for use by the Lich King's army."] = "通缉：蛆眼！就算以豺狼人的标准来看，这也是一头恶心的野兽。蛆眼因对被遗忘者犯下的罪行被判处死刑。这个卑鄙的恶棍一直在偷盗尸体，供巫妖王的军队使用。",
    ["According to Berard's Journal the moss from Lake Skulkers and Creepers might prove useful for our quest to brew a new plague. Those beasts dwell on the islands in Lake Lordamere to the east."] = "根据贝拉德的日志，湖泊潜伏者和爬行者身上的苔藓可能对我们酿造新瘟疫的研究有用。那些野兽栖息在东边洛达米尔湖的岛屿上。",
    ["As my understanding of Arugal's magic grows so does my disdain for the hapless fool. I am close to completing my research on his so called remedy."] = "随着我对阿鲁高魔法的了解加深，我对这个可怜傻瓜的鄙视也与日俱增。我就快完成对他所谓解药的研究了。",
    ["It's so cold, now. The Plague of Undeath crawls through my veins like an icy serpent. The Mindless State will be upon me soon. But no doomed destiny will prevent me from serving our Dark Lady."] = "现在好冷。亡灵瘟疫像一条冰冷的蛇在我血管里爬行。失去心智的状态很快就要降临我身上了。但没有任何厄运能阻止我侍奉我们的黑暗女王。",
    ["I now present you with the Water of the Seers. When you are ready, consume the waters near the tribal fire. Once you have ingested the holy waters, it will take a few moments before the vision materializes before the fire."] = "现在我把先知之水交给你。准备好后，在部落篝火旁喝下这水。喝下圣水之后，要过一会儿，幻象才会在火前显现。",
    ["Now that I have the spiders' venom, I'd like some live specimens to study. Unfortunately, capturing a living, giant spider is more than I can ask of you, young."] = "既然我已经有了蜘蛛的毒液，我想要一些活的标本来研究。可惜，捉一只活的巨型蜘蛛，对你这样的年轻人来说要求太高了。",
    ["A tauren skilled in the ways of the hunt knows that his prey is not for mere trophy. The beasts of the plains provide us with a means of survival."] = "精通狩猎之道的牛头人明白，猎物并不只是战利品。平原上的野兽为我们提供生存的手段。",
    ["We are hunters. Down below in Mulgore there is a mighty kodo named Arra'chea."] = "我们是猎人。下面的莫高雷有一头强大的科多兽，名叫阿拉奇亚。",
    ["The first order of business will be to put a little strength in your backbone. I could send you out to the Barrens to hunt kodo, but well, in all honesty, you're more useful to us alive than dead."] = "首要之事是让你的脊梁骨硬起来。我可以派你去贫瘠之地猎杀科多兽，不过说实话，你活着对我们更有用。",
    ["Seeing the deed you have done for me steels my heart. I cannot fall so easily! I must endure! But it remains that I cannot make the trek back to the Den unassisted."] = "看到你为我做的事，我的心坚定了起来。我不能这么轻易倒下！我必须坚持下去！但我仍无法在没有帮助的情况下回到洞穴。",
    ["Powerful warrior and awkward novice alike have fallen to the venomous sting of the scorpid. You will find large numbers of scorpids northwest of here."] = "强大的战士和笨拙的新手都曾倒在蝎子的毒刺之下。你会在这儿西北方发现大量蝎子。",
    ["Through my divinations, I see that an item of power hides deep within the Burning Blade Coven, guarded by beasts and black magic. It is called the Burning Blade Medallion, and your next task is to find it and remove it from the coven."] = "通过占卜，我看到一件强大的物品藏在燃刃兽穴的深处，由野兽和黑魔法守卫着。它叫做燃刃勋章，你的下一个任务就是找到它并把它带出兽穴。",
    ["One of my most observant scouts brings back word that the wreckage of Proudmoore's fleet still remains off the coast of Durotar, just east of Tiragarde Keep."] = "我最敏锐的一名斥候带回消息，普罗德摩尔舰队的残骸仍留在杜隆塔尔海岸外，提拉加德要塞的正东面。",
    ["... your timing is perfect. I just hope I can compliment your haste as well. I was careless while fighting a few of the venomtails nearby, and one of them stung me deeply."] = "……你来得正是时候。我只希望也能称赞你的速度。我在和附近几只毒尾蝎战斗时疏忽大意，其中一只狠狠蜇了我一下。",
    ["Lower your voice. The Kolkar centaurs lie just over the ridge to the west in Kolkar Crag."] = "小声点。科卡尔半人马就在西边山脊另一侧的科卡尔峭壁。",
    ["The witchdoctor Zalazane dwells on the Echo Isles to the east. They are the isles we once called home. From there he sends his trolls to the mainland, to hex our people and drag more of them under his sway."] = "巫医扎拉赞住在东边的回音群岛。那些岛屿曾是我们的家园。他从那里派出巨魔到大陆上，对我们的族人施以妖术，把更多人拖入他的控制。",
    ["We cannot allow the Burning Blade a foothold in Durotar! We must destroy them before their evil festers!"] = "我们不能让燃刃军团在杜隆塔尔站稳脚跟！我们必须在他们的邪恶蔓延之前消灭他们！",
    ["please, can you help me? My son Kron went hunting days ago, and he still hasn't returned. He went west towards the Barrens to hunt crocolisks along Southfury River."] = "求求你，你能帮帮我吗？我儿子克隆几天前出去打猎，到现在还没回来。他往西去了贫瘠之地，沿着怒水河猎鳄鱼。",
    [". The Burning Blade has infested the cave east of Orgrimmar known as Skull Rock. Inside that cave they perform vile rituals, and burn their own flesh with Searing Collars."] = "燃刃军团占据了奥格瑞玛以东一个名叫骷髅岩的洞穴。他们在洞里举行邪恶的仪式，用灼热项圈灼烧自己的血肉。",
    ["You have a promising air about you, and will prove yourself to the tribe. Perhaps someday soon you will be welcomed into the great city of Thunder Bluff."] = "你很有潜力，一定能在部落面前证明自己。也许不久之后，你就会受邀进入伟大的雷霆崖。",
    ["Greetings, young one. You have a gleam in your eye; I can tell you are eager to venture back to the plains for the hunt. May you bring honor to your clan!"] = "你好，年轻人。你眼中有光，我看得出你渴望回到平原去狩猎。愿你为你的氏族带来荣耀！",
    ["And again, it is your task to perform the ritual of cleansing. Go to the Thunderhorn Water Well, north of the village, and use the Thunderhorn Cleansing Totem in your ritual."] = "你的任务依然是进行净化仪式。前往村子北边的雷角水井，在仪式中使用雷角净化图腾。",
    ["According to the documents you salvaged from the caravan, the Venture Co. created many plans to attempt to drive us from our lands here, so that they could have free reign to plunder our lands."] = "根据你从商队抢救出来的文件，风险投资公司制定了许多计划，企图把我们赶出这里的土地，好让他们肆无忌惮地掠夺。",
    ["my brother soon stands before Chief Bloodhoof, and it is my honor to make his headdress for him. I want to ask a favor of you while I finish tanning these leather straps."] = "我哥哥很快就要站到血蹄酋长面前，我很荣幸能为他制作头饰。我鞣制这些皮带的时候，想请你帮个忙。",
    ["There are dwarves preparing a dig site to the northwest. They think secrets lie in the earth, and that is true, but hollowing and defiling the land is no way to earn its teachings."] = "西北面有矮人正在准备挖掘场。他们认为大地里藏着秘密，这没错，但是掏空和玷污大地，不是获得它教诲的方法。",
    ["The ragged hide of Ghost Howl still bears a terrible wound, gained from the wolf's battles against the Burning Legion. Perhaps someone in Bloodhoof Village should know of Ghost Howl's demise...."] = "幽灵嚎叫那破烂的皮毛上依旧带着一道可怕的伤口，那是这头狼与燃烧军团作战时留下的。也许血蹄村里的人应该知道幽灵嚎叫的死讯……",
    ["He told me of its demonic red eyes, razor-sharp talons and venomous bite. As fortune would have it, while traveling across the plains, I encountered it, and it took a nasty bite from my shoulder."] = "他告诉我它有着恶魔般的红眼睛、剃刀般锋利的利爪和有毒的毒牙。也是巧了，我在平原上赶路时遇到了它，它在我肩膀上狠狠咬了一口。",
    ["One of my scouts witnessed an attack on a caravan from Durotar. The culprits are indeed the Razormane tribe of quilboars. One of the quilboars in particular is leading the raids: Kreenig Snarlsnout."] = "我的一名斥候目睹了来自杜隆塔尔的商队遭到袭击。凶手确实是野猪人钢鬃部落。其中一只野猪人正带头发动袭击：克雷尼格·斯纳尔斯努特。",
    ["While I'd like to recover all my goods, I'm sure that's not possible. Still, there's a few things that I absolutely must have! As you see, my observatory is ready to go, but it needs the smaller of the two lenses."] = "虽然我想拿回我所有的货物，但我知道那是不可能的。不过，有几样东西我是绝对必须拥有的！如你所见，我的观测台已经准备就绪，可是它还需要两块镜片中较小的那一块。",
    ["The herbs of the Barrens are not quite like herbs in other lands. Their properties are mostly the same, but the oasis water here alters the plants; they are just slightly different."] = "贫瘠之地的草药和其他地方的不太一样。它们的特性大体相同，但这里绿洲的水改变了植物，所以略有不同。",
    ["The Kolkar are a threat to the Horde's claims in the Barrens; we must reduce the numbers of their troops. And so, I have a bounty task for you."] = "科卡尔对部落在贫瘠之地的领地构成威胁，我们必须削减他们的兵力。所以，我有一个悬赏任务给你。",
    ["Greetings. I am Conservator Ilthalaine. My purpose in Shadowglen is to ensure that the balance of nature is maintained."] = "你好。我是守护者伊尔塔莱恩。我在暗影谷的职责是确保自然的平衡得以维持。",
    ["Something evil is brewing in the forests of Teldrassil. Look long the hills to where the peaceful furbolgs used to dwell. They have deserted their homes and are amassing under the name of the Gnarlpine tribe."] = "泰达希尔的森林里正在酝酿着邪恶。沿着山丘望去，那里曾是和平的熊怪居住的地方。他们已经离开了家园，以夹松部族的名义聚集起来。",
    ["Thinning the younger population of creatures here in Shadowglen was a good start, but there is still work to be done. The resources of the forest will be depleted too quickly if the problem is not addressed."] = "削减暗影谷这里的幼年生物是个好开始，但仍有工作要做。如果不解决这个问题，森林的资源会消耗得太快。",
    ["The Demon Seed is a powerful tool for the Burning Legion. It rests in a cave on Dreadmist Peak, above a demonic altar of fire. I have prepared power stones that when placed near the Seed will disrupt its connection to the Legion."] = "恶魔之种是燃烧军团手中的强大工具。它安放在恐雾峰上的一个洞穴里，在一座恶魔火焰祭坛之上。我准备了能量石，放在种子附近就能破坏它与军团的联系。",
    ["In a cave along the southern bank of the lake, a timberling named Oakenscowl is spreading corruption to all the creatures that make Lake Al'Ameth their home."] = "在湖泊南岸的一个洞穴里，一个名叫橡怒的小树人正在向所有以阿拉梅斯湖为家的生物散播腐化。",
    ["Now the time has come to save the Druids of the Talon. If we fail now, they will be forever lost in sleep. I shall prepare the Relics of Wakening and perform the ritual."] = "现在是拯救利爪德鲁伊的时候了。如果现在失败，他们将永远沉睡。我会准备唤醒圣物并举行仪式。",
    ["I was dispatched with a small group of Sentinels here to protect the Oracle Tree from the harpies that have made nests all around the glade."] = "我与一小队哨兵被派来这里保护神谕之树，防止那些在林间空地四周筑巢的鹰身人。",
    ["Small timberlings are sprouting around the waters of Lake Al'Ameth. I'm afraid these sprouts are beyond help -- we should try to clear them from the land before they grow large enough to cause trouble."] = "小树人正在阿拉梅斯湖水边萌发。恐怕这些幼苗已经无药可救——我们应该在它们长大到足以惹出麻烦之前把它们从这片土地上清除。",
    [". A task I would ask of you. Have you seen the ruins of Ameth'Aran? If not, you will find them on the eastern side of the main road, some ways to the south."] = "。我想请你办一件事。你见过阿梅萨兰废墟吗？如果没有，它们就在主路东侧，往南走一段路就是。",
    ["It was the craft of one of the most powerful of the Highborne that created the seal that formed my prison. In Ameth'Aran, the ruins to the south that are twin to these, persists even today an ancient flame, blue in color."] = "是最强大的高等精灵之一的手艺造出了囚禁我的封印。在南边与这里相似的废墟阿梅萨兰，至今仍存在一团蓝色的远古火焰。",
    ["The Battleboars of Brambleblade Ravine to the east are encroaching on our tribal hunting grounds. They are trained to be malicious by the Bristleback Quilboars with whom we are at war."] = "东边荆棘刃峡谷的战猪正在侵入我们部族的狩猎场。它们是被与我们交战的刺背野猪人训练得凶恶的。",
    ["My duties include tending to our wounded warriors, tailoring armor and clothes, and assisting Shadow Priest Sarvis with whatever else he might need."] = "我的职责包括照料我们受伤的战士，缝制护甲和衣物，以及协助暗影牧师萨维斯处理他需要的其他任何事情。",
    ["Wanted: Hogger A huge gnoll, Hogger, is prowling the woods in southwestern Elwynn. He has overpowered all attempts at his capture. The Stormwind Army has placed a generous bounty on the Gnoll."] = "通缉：霍格。一头名叫霍格的巨大豺狼人正在艾尔文森林西南部的林子里游荡。所有捉拿他的尝试都被他击溃。暴风城军队为这头豺狼人悬赏了一大笔赏金。",
    ["I hope you're here to lend us a hand. After the last trogg attack, we could use all the help we can get. I hear the buggers have been popping up all across the lands, and it seems Coldridge Valley is no exception."] = "希望你是来帮我们的。上次穴居人袭击之后，我们需要一切能得到的帮助。我听说那些家伙在各地冒出来，冰冷山谷似乎也不例外。",
    ["After examining this charm, I see now what must be done. Please take it, and do as I ask. You are to explore the deepest areas of the Ban'ethil Barrow Den."] = "检查过这枚护符后，我现在明白该做什么了。请拿着它，照我说的做。你要去探索班尼希尔墓穴的最深处。",
    ["Now you must finish the task to which you have been appointed. Take the spinnerets and offer Lady Sathrah's sacrifice to Elune; lay the great spider to rest."] = "现在你必须完成交给你的任务。拿上纺丝器，向艾露恩献上萨拉丝夫人的祭品，让那只巨大的蜘蛛安息。",
    ["Gnarlpine invaders were seen ravaging the Ban'ethil Barrow Den to the west. The slumbering druids will be trapped in the Emerald Dream for eternity, unaware of their fate, unless we help."] = "有人看到夹松入侵者正在破坏西边的班尼希尔墓穴。除非我们出手相助，沉睡的德鲁伊将永远被困在翡翠梦境中，对自己的命运一无所知。",
    ["- I have heard of you, newcomer. Perhaps it is you that will help us, where others have failed. We tauren have carved a home out of this land, but not without a cost."] = "——我听说过你，新来的。也许是你能在别人失败的地方帮助我们。我们牛头人在这片土地上开辟了家园，但这并非没有代价。",
    ["The antidote is ready. Please see that Iverron drinks it. There is something that you should know -- the antidote -- it will only remain viable for 5 minutes."] = "解药准备好了。请务必让伊维隆喝下。有件事你应该知道——这解药只有5分钟的有效时间。",
    ["You'll find Brother Neals in the abbey, in the bell tower... where he likes to taste his wine."] = "你会在修道院的钟楼里找到尼尔斯修士……他喜欢在那里品尝他的葡萄酒。",
    ["You there! If you're looking for something to make yourself useful, then listen up! We need fresh out-of-the-ground recruits to head into Deathknell and search for any sort of useful equipment."] = "喂，你！如果你想找点有用的事做，就听好了！我们需要刚从地里爬出来的新兵去丧钟镇，搜寻任何有用的装备。",
    ["You may have killed the raptors, but the silver they stole must be recovered! I have reports that the raptors have a large grouping of nests south of Ratchet, known as the Raptor Grounds."] = "你也许杀死了那些迅猛龙，但它们偷走的银子必须找回来！我得到报告，说迅猛龙在棘齿城以南有一大片巢穴，叫做迅猛龙平原。",
    ["You are one of my lieutenants! Prepare yourself. I will call upon you soon. My time spent on the Searing Blade may be all but wasted now, but that does not mean that the Shadow Council's schemes elsewhere must suffer."] = "你是我的一名副官！做好准备。我很快就会召唤你。我在燃刃上花的时间现在几乎白费了，但这并不意味着暗影议会在别处的计划就要受损。",
    ["Many denizens of the Legion bestow gifts on their followers as you may well know. Some of these gifts the Dark Lady feels would be better off in her hands than in the hands of those with..."] = "你很可能知道，军团的许多爪牙会赏赐礼物给他们的追随者。黑暗女王认为，其中有些礼物由她掌管会比落在那些人手里更好……",
    ["You find a satchel under the body of the tauren. It is still gripped tightly in his arms as though he was trying to protect it while being attacked by the troggs."] = "你在牛头人的尸体下发现了一个背包。他的双臂仍紧紧抱着它，仿佛在遭到穴居人攻击时想要保护它。",
    ["Mellifluous liquid clear as a baby's tears Turns a lovely deep amber over the years But before we proceed to get lit to the hilt A barrel of charred oak must be built."] = "甘醇的液体清澈如婴儿的泪，岁月流转化作琥珀深黄。但在我们开怀畅饮之前，必须先造一只焦橡木桶。",
    ["Return to your own tribe and let them know of your victory here. Show them your trophy, and bask in the glory..."] = "回到你自己的部落，让他们知道你在这里的胜利。给他们看你的战利品，沐浴在荣耀之中……",
    ["When my life was ended upon the rocks, I had no clue what the afterlife held for me. The Lighthouse was black that night because Old Murk-Eye had scared the keeper's family off."] = "当我的生命在岩石上终结时，我不知道来世会给我带来什么。那天夜里灯塔是黑的，因为老瞎眼把守塔人的家人吓跑了。",
    ["You have proven your loyalty to King Magni. And your hatred for the Dark Iron scum is as great as my own. There is a task I wish to complete myself but I am bound by honor to stay with Longbraid."] = "你已经证明了对麦格尼国王的忠诚。你对黑铁渣滓的仇恨也和我一样深。有一件事我想亲自去做，但荣誉要求我留在长辫身边。",
    ["I find myself in quite a pinch here. The bottles are close to running dry. The latest booze shipment is long overdue. The orc invasion has been hell."] = "我发现自己陷入了相当为难的处境。酒瓶快要见底了。最近一批酒早就该到了。兽人入侵简直是地狱。",
    ["I need some underbelly scales from black dragon whelps to pay for the shoes Argus sent me from Goldshire."] = "我需要黑龙幼崽的腹部鳞片，来支付阿古斯从闪金镇寄给我的那双鞋。",
    ["During the last orc invasion we were forced to smelt our iron down to make bullets, swords and armor."] = "上一次兽人入侵时，我们不得不把铁熔化，用来制造子弹、刀剑和护甲。",
    ["You have uncovered a dark threat to the land. The Resonite cask you have found in that cave houses a slumbering Earthen by the name of Goggeroc."] = "你发现了这片土地上的一个黑暗威胁。你在那个洞穴里找到的共鸣石桶里，封印着一个沉睡的土灵，名叫戈格罗克。",
    ["Targorr the Dread served under Gath'Ilzogg as supreme Executioner. His methods were ruthless, even by filthy orc standards. Men who fought bravely to defend the Kingdom were tortured on his whim."] = "恐惧者塔戈尔曾在加斯·伊尔佐格麾下担任最高刽子手。即使以肮脏的兽人标准来看，他的手段也是残忍无情的。英勇保卫王国的人们因他一时兴起而遭受折磨。",
    ["the gnolls are still out there. I can hear their baying as they hunt in the hills above Lakeshire. And one cry is louder than the rest - Yowler, their leader."] = "豺狼人还在外面。我能听到它们在湖畔镇上方的山丘里狩猎时的嚎叫。其中有一声比其他的都响——嚎叫者，它们的首领。",
    ["our scouts have identified the leader of this recent Trogg incursion. It appears that these beasts in Loch Modan are following the lead of a chieftain named Grawmug."] = "我们的斥候已经查明了这次穴居人入侵的首领。洛克莫丹的这些野兽似乎是在跟随一个名叫格劳姆格的酋长。",
    ["By order of the Magistrate of Thelsamar: Chok'sul, the ogre presumed to be the leader and coordinator of attacks against the town of Thelsamar, Stonewrought Dam, and the excavation site, is wanted dead through any means necessary."] = "奉塞尔萨玛行政官之令：食人魔乔克苏尔被认为是袭击塞尔萨玛镇、石堤水坝和挖掘场的首领和协调者，现通缉其死活，可不择手段。",
    ["The harlot! The swine! Kenata still lives; her family healthy and prospering while I suffer. Forsaken indeed! My family is gone, taken by the plague."] = "那个婊子！那头猪！凯娜塔还活着；她的家人健康又兴旺，而我却在受苦。真是被遗忘者！我的家人没了，被瘟疫夺走了。",
    ["Many of my friends perished that horrible day when the mine tunnel caved in. If your adventures happen to bring you into that wing of the mine in Moonbrook, please keep an eye out for any sign which might identify them."] = "那个可怕的日子，矿洞坍塌时，我的许多朋友都死了。如果你的冒险恰好把你带到月溪那座矿洞的那一翼，请留意任何能辨认出他们的痕迹。",
    ["Edwin VanCleef must be assassinated. While it saddens me to condemn any man to a death sentence, it is for the greater good of the people of Westfall that VanCleef is laid to rest once and for all."] = "爱德温·范克里夫必须被刺杀。虽然判任何人死刑都让我难过，但为了西部荒野人民的更大利益，必须让范克里夫彻底安息。",
    ["Travel to his cottage just north of town, and execute Stalvan, once and for all. When the deed is done, travel to Madame Eva's and show her his family ring."] = "前往镇子北边的他的小屋，处决斯塔尔文，一了百了。事成之后，前往伊娃夫人那里，把他的家族戒指给她看。",
    ["It's no secret that the trademark of the Defias Gang is their Red Bandanas. But we've learned that the material from which these bandanas are made signifies the member's rank."] = "迪菲亚兄弟会的标志是他们的红色头巾，这早已不是秘密。但我们已经发现，制作这些头巾的材料代表着成员的等级。",
    ["I, the great Bartolo, shall make for you the world famous, Alliance renowned, Yeti Fur Cloak!"] = "我，伟大的巴托洛，将为你制作举世闻名、在联盟中享有盛誉的雪人皮毛斗篷！",
    ["You got here just in the nick of time! The Pyrewood Council will be returning any moment. Arugal has other matters to tend to in the keep. He uses the Council as mere puppets to keep the mindless minions of Pyrewood under his control."] = "你来得正是时候！火林议会随时都会回来。阿鲁高在城堡里还有其他事要处理。他把议会当作傀儡，来控制火林那些没有头脑的爪牙。",
    ["Here you go. Bring this message to Master Carevin. A few more like you, and we will outnumber the Night Watch! Perhaps then we could complete the work that we few carry on today."] = "给你。把这封信带给卡雷文大师。再有几个像你这样的人，我们的人数就要超过守夜人了！也许那时我们就能完成我们这少数几个人今天仍在继续的工作。",
    ["The keg fizzles slightly."] = "酒桶微微地冒着泡。",
    ["Just before the invasion I uncovered a large tablet called the Goaz Stone. The translated text breaks off in 4 places. The text speaks of a \"divine plan\" and a \"doomed prophecy.\" I fear we are running out of time."] = "就在入侵之前，我发现了一块名叫戈阿兹石的大石板。翻译出的文字有4处中断。文字谈到了一个“神圣的计划”和一个“注定的预言”。我担心我们的时间不多了。",
    ["I have prepared a report for the King. I believe you should be the one to deliver it to him, along with an account of your findings. Do not worry, there is no doubt that he will commend you for doing your duty to the people of Stormwind."] = "我为国王准备了一份报告。我认为应该由你把它交给他，并附上你的发现记述。不用担心，他一定会为你对暴风城人民尽到的职责而嘉奖你。",
    ["I can't lift the curse from the Eye of Paleth."] = "我无法解除帕雷斯之眼上的诅咒。",
    ["After pulling the barrel free from the muck and opening it, a silvery figurine is found packed in fine straw. It depicts a young, long-haired Paladin with hammer upraised."] = "把桶从烂泥里拉出来并打开后，你发现一尊银色的小雕像，用细稻草包着。它描绘的是一位年轻的长发圣骑士，高举着锤子。",
    ["Morbent Fel hides in his lair, the house perched atop the hill to the east overlooking the Raven Hill cemetery. His time in this land is drawing to an end..."] = "莫尔本特·费尔藏在他的巢穴里，那是东边山顶上俯瞰乌鸦岭墓地的那座房子。他在这片土地上的日子快要到头了……",
    ["We have a real infestation problem to the west. Tunnel rat kobolds have moved into the foothills, setting up dens and fouling our land with their filth!"] = "我们西边出现了严重的虫害。隧道鼠狗头人搬进了山麓，建造巢穴，用它们的污秽玷污我们的土地！",
    ["Ready to go? First, we need to get this powder to Ironband. It'll be a lot for me to carry, and these parts can get dangerous -- and who knows what else the Dark Irons might have in store for me."] = "准备好出发了吗？首先，我们得把这批火药送到铁带那里。我一个人搬会很吃力，而这一带可能很危险——天知道黑铁矮人还给我准备了什么。",
    ["Valdred, once my good friend, was my wife's murderer. Although I am incapable of grieving, I do yearn for revenge. If you kill Valdred and bring me his cursed hands, then I will reward you."] = "瓦尔德雷德曾是我的好朋友，却是杀害我妻子的凶手。虽然我已无法悲伤，但我渴望复仇。如果你杀了瓦尔德雷德，把他那双被诅咒的手带来给我，我就会奖励你。",
    ["In preparation for an assault on Shadowfang, two deathstalkers were sent to the keep to gather intelligence."] = "为了准备进攻影牙城堡，两名死亡猎手被派往城堡收集情报。",
    ["Sure enough, deep within the Old Jug there is another clue to Sander's treasure."] = "果然，在旧酒壶的深处还有另一条通往桑德宝藏的线索。",
    ["At last, friends of the Alliance! Help... please... The last thing I remember these foul Orcs overpowered our regiment. Most the men were killed."] = "终于，联盟的朋友！帮帮我……求你……我记得的最后一件事，是这些肮脏的兽人击溃了我们的团。大部分人都被杀了。",
    ["An archmage of great power is overseeing the reactivation of the ley energy node. With the progress they have made, our only hope of stopping them is by killing him."] = "一位强大的大法师正在监督魔力节点的重新启动。以他们目前的进展，我们阻止他们的唯一希望就是杀死他。",
    ["Thule once told me that, long ago, he and two colleagues created a magic wand, woven together from the apprentice wands each mage possessed."] = "图尔曾告诉我，很久以前，他和两位同事用每位法师各自拥有的学徒法杖编织在一起，制成了一根魔杖。",
    ["Now is the time to assault the Scourge's place of strength in Silverpine: Fenris Isle. You must again go to the Isle and destroy Thule Ravenclaw."] = "现在是攻击天灾军团在银松森林的力量据点的时候了：芬里斯岛。你必须再次前往那座岛，消灭图尔·鸦爪。",
    ["The Defias Front is constantly shifting. I've been following their movements for quite some time now. On a side note, I've ascertained that many members of the gang can be tracked by the Red Leather Bandanas they wear."] = "迪菲亚战线在不断变动。我已经跟踪他们的行动相当长一段时间了。顺便说一句，我已经确认，帮派中的许多成员可以通过他们佩戴的红色皮革头巾来追踪。",
    ["The Embalmer is a name told in one of our children's stories. He was a kindly alchemist, driven mad by the death of his wife, Eliza. To restore her, he used dark magic to place his own heart within the bosom of his dead spouse."] = "防腐者是我们孩子们的故事里的一个名字。他曾是一位善良的炼金术士，因妻子伊莉莎之死而发疯。为了让她复活，他用黑暗魔法把自己的心脏放进了亡妻的胸膛里。",
    ["I sent my apprentice out into the marshes to skin some of our famous giant Wetlands crocolisks. When he didn't return, I went out to look for him..."] = "我派学徒去沼泽里剥一些我们著名的湿地巨型鳄鱼的皮。他没有回来，我就出去找他……",
    ["While you were down there I happened to notice that one of those beasts stood out from the rest. He was bigger and more menacing. I bet he's the one who led the others here to cause the disruption to the dig site."] = "你在下面的时候，我碰巧注意到其中一头野兽比其他的更突出。它更大，更凶恶。我敢打赌，就是它带着其他的来到这里，扰乱了挖掘场。",
    ["My brother Quinn and I were tasked to recon Silverpine Forest and report to High Executor Hadrec. But we didn't get far -- when moving through this farm we were attacked by the ghoul Ivar the Foul."] = "我哥哥奎因和我奉命侦察银松森林，并向高阶执行者哈德雷克汇报。但我们没走多远——穿过这座农场时，我们遭到了食尸鬼“污秽者”艾瓦尔的袭击。",
    ["Dangerous! The following humans of Hillsbrad have been deemed dangerous and are marked for bounty by High Executor Darthalia: Clerk Horrace Whitesteed."] = "危险！希尔斯布莱德的以下人类已被认定为危险人物，并由高阶执行者达尔萨莉亚悬赏通缉：文书霍拉斯·白马。",
    ["I hear you were enlisted by Darthalia to wage war on the humans of Hillsbrad. So jealous I am..."] = "我听说你被达尔萨莉亚征召去对希尔斯布莱德的人类发动战争。我真是羡慕啊……",
    ["Oh...the flowers are blooming in Hillsbrad and the air is so fresh and brisk. I can't help but to wallow in the misery of it all. I look out my grimy window and long for the day when our New Plague brings this world the death it deserves."] = "哦……希尔斯布莱德的花儿开了，空气是那么清新爽朗。我忍不住沉溺在这一切的悲惨之中。我望着肮脏的窗外，渴望着我们的新瘟疫给这个世界带来它应得的死亡的那一天。",
    ["A mudsnout composite? Absolutely brilliant! Why didn't I think of that? Let me contribute my colloid of decay to this devilish brew."] = "泥鼻合成物？绝妙！我怎么没想到呢？让我把我的腐败胶体也加进这副恶魔般的混合物里。",
    ["High Executor Darthalia sent me to keep watch of Dun Garok from a distance. I had set up camp just out of sight. But when morning came and I had to boil water, I left to gather firewood."] = "高阶执行者达尔萨莉亚派我远远地监视敦加洛克。我在不远处扎了营。可是早晨到了，我要烧水，就离开去捡柴火。",
    ["Ain't nothin' that irks me more than losin' these here beautiful horses."] = "没有什么比失去这些漂亮的马更让我恼火了。",
    ["I am the new magistrate of Southshore, recently assigned after the assassination of the previous magistrate."] = "我是南海镇的新任行政官，是在前任行政官遇刺后不久任命的。",
    ["Take this sealed commendation to Varimathras in the Undercity."] = "把这封封好的嘉奖信带给幽暗城的瓦里玛萨斯。",
    ["Here is the final challenge that I will put forth. We've been tracking an elusive tiger for weeks."] = "这是我要提出的最后一个挑战。我们已经追踪一只难以捉摸的老虎好几个星期了。",
    ["You've almost proven yourself to be a master hunter of panthers."] = "你几乎已经证明了自己是猎豹的大师级猎人。",
    ["For this, I use only the best elder croc skins. They are more durable and a better canvas--if you will--for adding the designs and accents that make Drizzlik's Excelsior line."] = "为此，我只用最好的老鳄鱼皮。它们更耐用，也是更好的画布——如果你愿意这么说——可以添加构成德里兹利克卓越系列的图案和点缀。",
    ["There is but one final reagent needed to complete the enchantment. In the south, towards the western coast, high above the bluffs, lies a Holy Spring."] = "完成附魔只差最后一样材料。在南边，靠近西海岸，在悬崖高处，有一处圣泉。",
    ["Avast! Who goes there? Argh, I am but useless without me special enchanted eye. Bad enough to have lost me eyes in battle in the first place!"] = "喂！谁在那儿？啊，没有我那只特别的魔法眼睛，我就一无是处。当初在战斗中失去眼睛已经够糟了！",
    ["Because you proved yourself to be such a go-getter in the jungle, let me tell you about a ferocious raptor that even I have failed to kill."] = "既然你在丛林里表现得如此积极，让我告诉你一头凶猛的迅猛龙，就连我也没能杀死它。",
    ["So you're looking for an altar of some sort? Well, I'm no expert on troll ruins like my father, but I have heard about a sunken troll city out near that island you're looking for."] = "这么说你在找某种祭坛？嗯，我不像我父亲那样精通巨魔遗迹，不过我听说在你要找的那座岛附近有一座沉没的巨魔城市。",
    ["Although no mention of Private Thorsen is found in these records, hidden within the binding of one of Herod's ledger books is a small, brass key."] = "虽然这些记录里没有提到索森二等兵，但在希律的一本账簿的封皮夹层里藏着一把小黄铜钥匙。",
    ["While you were gone I fixed the pot you brought me. I even added an extra steam whistle, and look! There's a new chopper at the bottom that'll cut through leg bones!"] = "你不在的时候我修好了你带给我的锅。我甚至多加了一个蒸汽哨子，看！底部还有一把新的砍刀，能砍断腿骨！",
    ["Kurzen may be dead, but...that which drove him to evil still lives! Through my studies I have discovered this: An Ogre Mage - Mai'Zoth - dwells in an Ogre Mound within the eastern mountains of Stranglethorn."] = "库尔森也许死了，但是……驱使他作恶的东西还活着！经过我的研究，我发现了这个：一名食人魔法师——麦佐斯——住在荆棘谷东部山区的一座食人魔土丘里。",
    ["The Venture Company has a string of operations through Stranglethorn which keeps hard-working goblins, like me, from making honest gold! Please, you must help me!"] = "风险投资公司在荆棘谷各地经营着一系列产业，让像我这样辛勤工作的地精无法赚到老实钱！求求你，你一定要帮我！",
    ["Negolash is a hungry giant. When the giants destroyed our ship, Negolash went straight for my kitchen. He wasn't hungry for crew like the other giants."] = "内戈拉什是个饥饿的巨人。巨人们摧毁我们的船时，内戈拉什径直冲向我的厨房。他不像其他巨人那样渴求船员。",
    ["Zanzil the Outcast dwells with his followers in the Jubuwal and Aboraz Ruins, northeast of Booty Bay. He is exiled from his tribe. Why? Well..."] = "被放逐者赞吉尔和他的追随者住在藏宝海湾东北面的朱布瓦尔和阿博拉兹废墟。他被自己的部落放逐了。为什么？嗯……",
    ["We must find if Yenniku is dead. Slay the Bloodscalp Headhunters and take from them their Shrunken Heads. You must gather many, many heads, and I will inspect them to make sure Yenniku's head is not among them."] = "我们必须弄清耶尼库是否已死。杀死血顶猎头者，从他们身上取得缩小的头颅。你必须收集很多很多颗头颅，我会检查，确保里面没有耶尼库的头。",
    ["I have reshaped the Mind's Eye into a Soul Gem. Its purpose is twofold: you must use it to stun Yenniku, and once stunned place it upon his head to entrap his soul."] = "我已将心灵之眼重塑成了灵魂宝石。它有双重用途：你必须用它来击晕耶尼库，击晕后把它放在他头上，困住他的灵魂。",
    ["I was sent to Grom'gol to aid Nimboya on his quest, but... I too have reasons for being here. The Bloodscalp tribe is enemy to our tribe. Collecting trophies of our enemies gives us power over them."] = "我被派往格罗姆高协助尼姆博亚完成任务，但是……我来这里也有自己的原因。血顶部落是我们部落的敌人。收集敌人的战利品，能让我们对他们拥有力量。",
    ["Now that you have gathered Bloodscalp trophies, I have another task for you. The Skullsplitter tribe of trolls live to the southeast, and for years we have warred with them."] = "既然你已经收集了血顶部落的战利品，我还有另一项任务交给你。碎颅者巨魔部落住在东南面，多年来我们一直和他们交战。",
    ["Did Lieutenant Doren want you to report back to him with that patrol information?"] = "多伦中尉是不是想让你把巡逻情报向他汇报？",
    ["To have a chance against Kurzen, we need his healing support neutralized. He has gathered a large number of Medicine Men who heal his forces with Jungle Remedies and poison our fighters with Venom Fern Extracts."] = "想要对抗库尔森，我们就得让他的治疗支援失效。他召集了大批巫医，用丛林药剂治疗他的部队，并用毒蕨提取物毒害我们的战士。",
    ["Poor Heralath! And this dwarf... Lonebrow. What a brave soul he was. We must not let their valiance go for naught. This crone... Charlga Razorflank..."] = "可怜的赫拉拉斯！还有这位矮人……独眉。他是多么勇敢的灵魂。我们决不能让他们的英勇白白浪费。这个老太婆……查尔加·剃刀沼泽……",
    ["All that remains is to deliver the Crown of Will to Sharlindra in the Undercity. She will see that it is delivered to Lady Sylvanas."] = "剩下的就是把意志之冠送到幽暗城的莎琳德拉那里。她会负责把它交给希尔瓦娜斯女士。",
    ["Heavens no! Poor Rustlocke. 'Tis quite a tragedy indeed. We must not let his death pass in vain."] = "天哪，不！可怜的拉斯洛克。这真是一场悲剧。我们决不能让他的死变得毫无意义。",
    ["Argh, 'tis a horrible life. I should be in a watery grave right now, not sittin' here by the fire, breathin' fresh air. The crew tried so hard to save my beautiful Maiden's Folly."] = "唉，这日子真是糟透了。我现在本该躺在水底的坟墓里，而不是坐在这里烤着火、呼吸着新鲜空气。船员们拼命想救我那艘美丽的“少女之愚”号。",
    ["Such a shame the land is in such shambles. But the Memorial came out quite well!"] = "这片土地竟然如此破败，真是可惜。不过纪念碑倒是建得相当不错！",
    ["There is no doubt in my mind that a powerful warlock resides within the walls of Stromgarde. From time to time, using an arcane magical relic, this warlock has summoned forth terrible demons in large numbers."] = "我毫不怀疑，在斯通纳德的城墙内住着一名强大的术士。这名术士不时利用一件奥术魔法圣物，召唤出大批可怕的恶魔。",
    ["This is bad. It seems the Daggerspines are amassing for an attack. Naga are known for their ruthlessness in battle. They will keep attacking until I am dead."] = "情况不妙。看来匕首岭一族正在集结准备进攻。纳迦在战斗中的无情是出了名的。他们会一直攻击，直到我死去。",
    ["Even though my will is free, I can serve the Dark Lady no more. I feel my time on Azeroth has come to an end. My life force is shattered. Interrogator Vishas did this to me!"] = "虽然我的意志是自由的，但我再也无法侍奉黑暗女王了。我感到我在艾泽拉斯的时间已经走到尽头。我的生命力已经破碎。这都是审问者维沙斯干的！",
    ["You must defeat Myzrael before she grows in strength. If you do not, then once she has gathered enough power she will challenge her captors!"] = "你必须在迈兹蕾尔变强之前打败她。否则，一旦她积聚了足够的力量，她就会向囚禁她的人发起挑战！",
    ["A bounty has been placed on the head of Marez Cowl, a high-level advisor and operative of the Syndicate. She was last seen within the Syndicate controlled territory of Stromgarde."] = "辛迪加的高级顾问兼特工马雷兹·考尔的头颅已被悬赏。她最后一次被人看到是在辛迪加控制的斯通纳德领地内。",
    ["Oh my! Oh my! There is a doom approaching. Mark me! A doom! No, I cannot speak of it...cannot utter their names or they may hear me! But if we learn, yes, if we learn more of them...then maybe we can learn how to foil them!"] = "哦天哪！哦天哪！有一场厄运正在逼近。记住我的话！一场厄运！不，我不能说……不能说出他们的名字，否则他们可能会听到我！但如果我们了解，对，如果我们了解更多关于他们的事……也许我们就能知道如何挫败他们！",
    ["Maybe it'll even help protect you from the coming atrocity that is Lotwil's newest invention. I've been working with all the extra stones you collected for him, and I can make some nice bracers that you might want to use."] = "也许它甚至能帮你抵御即将到来的暴行，也就是洛特维尔的最新发明。我一直在用你为他收集的所有多余石头做东西，我能做一副不错的护腕，你也许用得上。",
    ["The last report I received from Agmond is troubling, more so now that he's dead! He mentioned that his diggers uncovered \"ancient urns\" at the dig site outside Uldaman."] = "我从阿格蒙德那里收到的最后一份报告令人不安，现在他死了就更令人担忧！他提到他的挖掘工人在奥达曼外的挖掘场发现了“古代的瓮”。",
    ["Agmond's tracks lead from the west. It is easy to tell from the bloody smears across rock and sand that the dwarf crawled some distance."] = "阿格蒙德的足迹从西边延伸过来。从岩石和沙地上的血迹很容易看出，那个矮人爬行了相当长一段距离。",
    ["I have the digest for you. I need not tell you to take great care with it. And to keep it far from unfriendly hands. This book holds many truths......And the truth can burn."] = "我为你准备了一份摘要。不用我说你也该知道要小心保管，并且让它远离不友好的人。这本书里有许多真相……而真相是会灼人的。",
    ["After much observation, I have discovered Morganth's plans. He searches for the Scythe of Elune...and he may have found it! If he has, then the Redridge Mountains, and the kingdom of Stormwind, will soon feel his dark might."] = "经过长期观察，我发现了摩根斯的计划。他在寻找艾露恩之镰……而且他可能已经找到了！如果是这样，赤脊山和暴风城王国很快就会感受到他的黑暗力量。",
    ["You did so well with the lieutenants and underlings that I'd like you to do one last thing for me. Serena Bloodfeather is the sister of a harpy named Bloodfeather who was slain by Rexxar quite a while ago."] = "你对付那些副官和喽啰干得太出色了，所以我想请你为我做最后一件事。瑟蕾娜·血羽是一只名叫血羽的鹰身人的姐妹，那只鹰身人很久以前被雷克萨杀死了。",
    ["The thunderhawk, is a fierce beast. It is time for you to face them. You must find where it roams, and bring me its wings as proof of your successful hunt."] = "雷鹰是一种凶猛的野兽。是时候让你去面对它们了。你必须找到它出没的地方，把它的翅膀带给我，作为你狩猎成功的证明。",
    ["Yet another ship from my fleet has been lost to those overzealous humans at Northwatch Hold! Those bastards must be dealt with. Their paranoia has them in a state of frenzy."] = "我舰队的又一艘船被北郡要塞那些过度热心的人类击沉了！必须收拾那些混蛋。他们的偏执已使他们陷入疯狂。",
    ["Finally! Someone to rescue me! I can't believe you got past the guards. These zealots from Theramore are out of their minds. They sank our ship and imprisoned me, the only survivor."] = "终于！有人来救我了！真不敢相信你竟然越过了守卫。这些来自塞拉摩的狂热分子简直疯了。他们击沉了我们的船，还把我这个唯一的幸存者关了起来。",
    ["Following Khazgorm's plans it should be no problem to fashion an explosive charge Ah, there we go. Now, I am going to entrust you with a special task."] = "按照卡兹戈姆的计划，制作一个爆破炸药应该没问题。啊，好了。现在我要托付你一项特殊的任务。",
    ["Perhaps you know the pain of uncertainty, perhaps not. But know this: I stand here every day, from the sun's rising till its decline, scouring the horizon for more of those monsters."] = "也许你了解不确定的痛苦，也许不了解。但要知道：我每天站在这里，从日出到日落，搜寻地平线上是否还有那些怪物。",
    ["Attention! A reward is being offered for the death of the murloc \"Murkdeep\"."] = "注意！悬赏击杀鱼人“莫克迪普”。",
    ["Take Lok's head to Thork in the Crossroads. He should know what has happened to my tribe without any words--ha, not that he would believe Mangletooth helped in such things."] = "把洛克的头带给十字路口的索克。他不用任何言语就该知道我的部落发生了什么……哈，不过他可不会相信曼格尔图斯帮过这种忙。",
    ["The Razormane quilboars to the south, beyond the Field of Giants, have no skilled blacksmiths from what I am told, but they've apparently started to develop sturdier weapons."] = "据我所知，南边巨人之原那边的钢鬃野猪人没有熟练的铁匠，但他们显然已经开始制造更坚固的武器了。",
    ["Pulling open the face of the control console reveals a dense jumble of wires, tubing and other strange mechanical objects--most of which seem to serve no practical purpose."] = "拉开控制台的面板，里面是一团密密麻麻的电线、管道和其他奇怪的机械装置——其中大部分似乎没有任何实际用途。",
    ["I suppose I'll learn as we go... Couldn't be too hard. Just some buttons here, and a lever or two... Well, are you ready to go?"] = "我想边走边学吧……应该不会太难。就是这儿几个按钮，一两个拉杆……好了，你准备好出发了吗？",
    ["I have rendered the spores you gave me into an emulsion. I must now send it to my associate, Apothecary Zamah. If you were to carry this to her, she can offer you something from our stores of alchemical goods."] = "我已经把你给我的孢子制成了乳剂。现在我必须把它送给我的同事，药剂师扎玛。如果你把它带给她，她会从我们的炼金物品库存里给你一些东西。",
    ["The raptors of the Barrens are smarter than raptors in other lands. And I think all that smarts is hiding in their horns!"] = "贫瘠之地的迅猛龙比其他地方的迅猛龙更聪明。我觉得所有的智慧都藏在它们的角里！",
    ["Hezrul Bloodmark is the leader of the Kolkar centaurs in the Barrens. He is fierce, brutal and cunning. Defeating him would disrupt and fracture the Kolkars, greatly reducing their threat to us."] = "赫兹鲁·血痕是贫瘠之地科卡尔半人马的首领。他凶猛、残暴又狡猾。打败他会瓦解并分裂科卡尔，大大降低他们对我们的威胁。",
    ["The grand Isha Awak is lord of these waters. Great is his strength, and solemn his pride. The humans on the coast fear him, for he has consumed many of their number."] = "伟大的伊莎·阿瓦克是这片水域的主人。他力量强大，自尊庄严。海岸上的人类惧怕他，因为他吞食了许多他们的人。",
    ["All right, force it is. Let's get out of here as soon as you're ready. We'll fight our way down to the road--Grimclaw should still be there."] = "好吧，那就硬闯。你准备好后我们就离开这里。我们一路杀到大路上——格里姆克劳应该还在那儿。",
    ["I am devising a potion that requires rare mushrooms, mushrooms that grow only in a certain cave. The cave lies behind Cliffspring Falls, to the east and slightly north along the mountains."] = "我正在调制一种药水，需要稀有的蘑菇，这种蘑菇只生长在某个洞穴里。那个洞穴在崖泉瀑布后面，沿着山脉往东稍微偏北。",
    ["In the aftermath of the battles at the Well of Eternity, I heard that Ameth'Aran had been destroyed, its people dead, including my love, Anaya."] = "在永恒之井的战斗之后，我听说阿梅萨兰被毁了，那里的人民都死了，包括我的爱人阿娜雅。",
    ["Ilkrud Magthrull. Yes, I have knowledge of him. He is a powerful orc warlock that makes his residence at the Fire Scar Shrine, a place of great evil in southwestern Ashenvale."] = "伊尔克鲁德·玛格斯鲁。是的，我知道他。他是个强大的兽人术士，住在火痕神殿，那是灰谷西南部一个极其邪恶的地方。",
    ["When I discovered the Stone of Relu, I believed it to be the key to unlocking the mystery of the fossil. While I traveled on the road to meet Whelgar, I was attacked by raptors and the relic was lost."] = "当我发现雷鲁之石时，我以为它是解开化石之谜的钥匙。我在路上去见维尔加时，遭到迅猛龙攻击，圣物也丢了。",
    ["So the prospector wants to send the mysterious fossil to the Explorers' League in Darnassus? I don't feel right leaving Darkshore without him."] = "所以勘探者想把那块神秘的化石送到达纳苏斯的探险者协会？没有他，我离开黑海岸心里不踏实。",
    ["The parchment you found at the Master's Glaive is a page from an ancient text...written by elves!"] = "你在大师之刃那里找到的羊皮纸是一部古代文献的一页……是精灵写的！",
    ["I fear the ancient statuette's secrets will remain forever hidden unless you find the key to its ancient lock. That key is a ring, the Ring of Zoram."] = "恐怕除非你找到开启它古老锁具的钥匙，这尊古代小雕像的秘密将永远被埋没。那把钥匙是一枚戒指，佐拉姆之戒。",
    ["Relara's fever has passed, but she is still very weak. I do not believe time alone will give her back the strength she has lost. I believe it will take the power of a moonstone."] = "蕾拉拉的高烧已经退了，但她仍然非常虚弱。我不认为光靠时间就能让她恢复失去的力量。我想需要月亮石的力量。",
    ["Anilia puts her hands on your shoulders and draws you close. Gasping, she points towards the arch to the north, before her eyes close and her last wheezing breath leaves her body."] = "阿妮莉亚把手搭在你的肩上，把你拉近。她喘息着指向北边的拱门，随后双眼闭上，最后一口喘息从她体内离去。",
    ["Blackrock Outrunners and Renegades are running ambushes between here and Stonewatch Keep. The leader of the Outrunners is an orc named Tharil'zun--we want this orc."] = "黑石疾行者和叛徒们正在这里和石望要塞之间设伏。疾行者的首领是一个名叫塔里尔祖恩的兽人——我们要这个兽人。",
    ["Now that I've finished copying the book, here's the original Stresses of Iron. Thank you for your patience, and if you see Milton please tell him I'm sorry for the long delay."] = "既然我已经抄完了这本书，这是原版的《钢铁的压力》。谢谢你的耐心，如果你见到米尔顿，请告诉他我为拖了这么久而抱歉。",
    ["Because you fought with such valor and perseverance in the Battle of Hillsbrad, I have written this commendation, extolling your heroics in combat for the high command to recognize."] = "由于你在希尔斯布莱德之战中表现出的勇气和毅力，我写了这份嘉奖信，颂扬你在战斗中的英勇事迹，好让最高指挥部看到。",
    ["Archmage Arugal called the worgen to Silverpine to defend against the Scourge, lost control of them immediately, and went mad in Shadowfang Keep among the things he had summoned."] = "大法师阿鲁高把狼人召唤到银松森林来抵御天灾军团，却立即失去了对它们的控制，并在影牙城堡里与他召唤出的东西为伴，发了疯。",
    ["Shadowfang Keep holds a book, the Book of Ur, which would be much prized in my collection. Ur was a great mage of Dalaran before the coming of the Scourge, his studies in other worlds are of much value to..."] = "影牙城堡里有一本书，乌尔之书，我的收藏里若有它会很珍贵。乌尔是天灾军团到来之前达拉然的一位伟大法师，他对其他世界的研究极有价值……",
    ["Arugal's own belt. He summoned the worgen to save Silverpine, then lost his mind in Shadowfang Keep surrounded by what he had called."] = "阿鲁高自己的腰带。他召唤狼人来拯救银松森林，然后在影牙城堡里被自己召唤出的东西包围，失去了理智。",
    ["Arugal still resides in Shadowfang Keep. We cannot claim Silverpine as a strategic stronghold for the Dark Lady until Arugal is slain. I shall see to it that his magic is eradicated."] = "阿鲁高仍然住在影牙城堡。在阿鲁高被杀之前，我们不能宣称银松森林是黑暗女王的战略据点。我会确保他的魔法被根除。",
    ["These deviate creatures have strange, otherworldly properties."] = "这些畸变的生物拥有奇异的、不属于这个世界的特性。",
    ["Hey. I been sent to the Crossroads to watch over the land and take note of its happenings for my masters in Orgrimmar. One object of my studies are the insect-like creatures found to the south in the Field of Giants."] = "嘿。我被派到十字路口监视这片土地，并为我在奥格瑞玛的主人们记录这里发生的事。我的研究对象之一，是南边巨人之原上发现的类似昆虫的生物。",
    ["The druids in the Wailing Caverns, the Druids of the Fang, are an aberration. They were part of an order of noble druids whose plan was to heal the Barrens, but now seek to remake that land to match their own, twisted dreams."] = "哀嚎洞穴里的德鲁伊，也就是尖牙德鲁伊，是一种异类。他们曾是一个高贵德鲁伊教团的成员，计划治愈贫瘠之地，但现在却想按照他们自己扭曲的梦想重塑那片土地。",
    ["All right then... if you're sure, we'll sneak out of here. Let us leave when you're ready. Remember, after you've escaped, meet Terenthis back in Auberdine."] = "好吧……如果你确定的话，我们就偷偷溜出去。等你准备好我们就离开。记住，逃出去之后，到奥伯丁去见泰伦希斯。",
    ["So excited I am! Three little cages for three little elves! But what shall we do with our lovely tree-hugging friends? Why, let's give them a taste of..."] = "我太兴奋了！三个小笼子关三个小精灵！可是我们该拿我们可爱的拥抱树木的朋友怎么办呢？嗯，让我们让他们尝尝……",
    ["I met Gerenzo once, but let me tell you, he's not easy on the eyes. His flesh looks like it's rotting away, and he's grafted metal and gears onto his body, replaced some of his limbs with mechanical ones."] = "我见过格伦佐一次，不过我告诉你，他可不好看。他的肉看起来像是在腐烂，他把金属和齿轮嫁接到身上，用机械替换了一些肢体。",
    ["The druids built the Talon Den on Stonetalon Peak, where they keep many powerful items. They devised a complex scheme to keep them from falling into the wrong hands."] = "德鲁伊在石爪峰上建造了利爪巢穴，在那里保管着许多强大的物品。他们设计了一个复杂的计划，防止这些物品落入坏人手中。",
    ["I am sure Tyrande Whisperwind herself would like to thank you for taking part in this mission. It may not appear so on the surface, but what you've helped start could very well strengthen our foothold in the Stonetalon Mountains."] = "我相信泰兰德·语风本人也会想感谢你参与这次任务。表面上看也许不明显，但你帮忙开启的事，很可能会巩固我们在石爪山脉的立足点。",
    ["As you may know, wyverns are often tamed by orcs for use as mounts. But what is less known is that the venom of a wyvern, in some circles, is more valuable than the beast itself."] = "你也许知道，飞龙常被兽人驯服来当坐骑。但鲜为人知的是，飞龙的毒液在某些圈子里比这头野兽本身更有价值。",
    ["it is now time for you to travel to far-off lands. You are ready. You now hunt Frostmaw, a yeti in the Alterac Mountains. He is elusive, his white coat blending into the snows of his mountain home."] = "现在是你前往遥远土地的时候了。你已经准备好了。你现在要猎杀霜喉，一头位于奥特兰克山脉的雪人。他行踪难觅，白色的皮毛与他山间家园的积雪融为一体。",
    ["There, I did what Razzeric wanted. Just tell him to be careful when he sets this off. If he makes the slightest mistake, he won't be moving forward, he'll just be a burnt spot on the track."] = "好了，我已经按拉泽瑞克的要求做完了。只要告诉他，引爆这东西的时候要小心。只要他稍有差池，他就不会前进，只会变成轨道上的一块焦痕。",
    ["Indurium has an amazing resistance to heat! I'm sure it will work for Fizzle's pistons. But he'll need true indurium ore, not just the flakes."] = "铜锭具有惊人的耐热性！我确信它能用在菲兹尔的活塞上。不过他需要真正的铜锭矿石，而不只是碎屑。",
    ["Using the water you brought, you will be able to temporarily douse the flame that holds the centaur relic. It will not work permanently, however, so you will have to be quick about it."] = "用你带来的水，你就能暂时浇灭守着半人马圣物的火焰。不过它不是永久的，所以你必须动作快。",
    ["As you might know, I collect lore. Old lore. Powerful lore. Lore that opens doorways, and lore that can awaken Those Who Sleep."] = "你也许知道，我收集传说。古老的传说。强大的传说。能开启门户的传说，还有能唤醒沉睡者的传说。",
    ["The fight goes well. Perhaps the Warchief will allow us to return to our homes before the seasons change if we continue to make such great strides in our battle against the demons and their underlings."] = "战斗进展顺利。如果我们继续在对抗恶魔及其爪牙的战斗中取得如此巨大的进展，也许酋长会允许我们在季节更替之前回家。",
    ["At last, help has arrived! You have no clue how long I've been held prisoner here. I can't remember the last time I saw the outside of this place."] = "终于，救援来了！你根本不知道我被关在这里多久了。我已经不记得上次看到这里外面是什么时候了。",
    ["I have not long to live... so... so... weak....the b-b-brave dwarf, Lonebrow, has been sent to w-w-warn Falfindel... But before I... d-d-die......my wife, Treshala..."] = "我活不了多久了……所以……所以……虚弱……勇敢的矮人，独眉，被派去警、警告法芬德尔……但在我……死、死之前……我的妻子，特蕾莎拉……",
    ["you helped us against the Magram. Now, help us beat the Maraudine! Kill the head of their clan, Khan Hratha! To face him, blow the Maraudine War Horn."] = "你帮助我们对抗了玛格拉姆。现在，帮助我们击败玛拉顿！杀死他们部落的首领，哈瑞斯汗！要面对他，吹响玛拉顿战争号角。",
    ["Now that you scared the centaur clans, it's time to bleed them. When traveling Desolace, hunt centaur. I don't care which clan you hunt. Just gather ears."] = "既然你吓住了半人马部落，现在是让他们流血的时候了。在凄凉之地旅行时，猎杀半人马。我不在乎你猎杀哪个部落。只管收集耳朵。",
    ["The Gelkis Khan is dead, and now the Maraudine will fall! Kill the Maraudine Khan, Hratha! To face him, blow the horn on the high bluff in the Valley of Spears."] = "盖尔基斯汗死了，现在玛拉顿也要倒下了！杀死玛拉顿汗，哈瑞斯！要面对他，吹响长矛谷高处悬崖上的号角。",
    ["Take Karnitol's things back to Roetten in Ironforge and he'll pay you for a job well done. Haha, if you're not careful, he's gonna be so pleased with ya that he'll ask you to join us full time."] = "把卡尼托尔的东西带回铁炉堡的罗伊顿那里，他会为你出色完成任务付钱。哈哈，你要是不小心，他会满意得请你全职加入我们。",
    ["To get paid, you're gonna have to get back to Ironforge and speak to Roetten himself. He'll love getting Leftwitch's package out of the way anyway."] = "要拿到报酬，你得回到铁炉堡，亲自跟罗伊顿谈。反正他会很乐意把莱夫特维奇的包裹处理掉。",
    ["Serra'kis is the great water beast the naga breed in the flooded halls of Blackfathom Deeps, and the reason the lower temple is under water at all."] = "瑟拉基斯是纳迦在黑暗深渊被淹没的大厅里饲养的巨型水兽，也是下层神殿完全沉没在水下的原因。",
    ["Ghamoo-ra is the ancient turtle the naga keep in Blackfathom Deeps -- old enough that the Twilight cultists there treat it as part of the temple."] = "加摩拉是纳迦在黑暗深渊里饲养的远古巨龟，年代久远到那里的暮光教徒把它视作神殿的一部分。",
    ["Empowered by the ancient rites of the chaotic Old Gods the members of the Twilight's Hammer strive to bring about the return of their dark patrons and spread death and terror across the world."] = "暮光之锤的成员因混乱的上古之神的古老仪式而获得力量，努力让他们黑暗的主人归来，并在世界各地散播死亡与恐惧。",
    ["Foolish blood elves toil with demonic magic. Have they not witnessed what happened with the naga and with the satyrs of Kalimdor? I fear that the blood elves will meet a similar deformation."] = "愚蠢的血精灵在摆弄恶魔魔法。他们没见过卡利姆多的纳迦和萨特发生了什么吗？我担心血精灵也会遭遇类似的畸变。",
    ["Now there is just one more item needed to complete this device. Cog's blueprint calls for a lens of some sort. The only lens I know of that would be large enough will be very difficult to acquire."] = "现在完成这个装置只差一件东西。科格的蓝图需要某种镜片。我所知道的唯一足够大的镜片，会非常难以获得。",
    ["The Scarlet Crusade's chief scholar, who guards the Monastery library and its collection rather more aggressively than a librarian should."] = "血色十字军的首席学者，守卫修道院图书馆及其藏书的方式，比图书管理员应有的要凶狠得多。",
    ["The survival of our people and lands comes at unfortunate costs. You have spilled the blood of nature's servants; many sick animals you have felled."] = "我们的人民和土地的存续是以不幸的代价换来的。你已经洒下了自然仆从的鲜血；你杀死了许多生病的动物。",
    ["The future is inevitable! We hurl ourselves towards it like falling raindrops to the Great Sea. But perhaps, by studying the past, we can know what to expect and be better prepared for the unknown."] = "未来是不可避免的！我们朝它投去，就像雨滴落入大海。但也许通过研究过去，我们能知道会发生什么，并为未知做好更充分的准备。",
    ["The Earthen Ring had pure intentions towards our plagued brethren. But who is to know the motivations of those whispering in the ears of the Elder Council?"] = "大地之环对我们受瘟疫侵袭的兄弟们怀有纯粹的意图。但谁能知道那些在长老议会耳边低语的人的动机呢？",
    ["Revelosh was a Shadowforge explorer who went into Uldaman looking for the origin of the dwarves, and became part of the ruin instead."] = "雷弗洛什是影炉的探险者，他进入奥达曼寻找矮人的起源，结果却成了废墟的一部分。",
    ["A Gnomeregan oddity whose Use effect grants a huge burst of attack speed. Feral druids kept it for that alone, because it works in cat form -- and it has limited charges, so every use is a decision."] = "一件诺莫瑞根的奇物，其使用效果能带来巨大的攻击速度爆发。野性德鲁伊就只为这一点留着它，因为它在猎豹形态下也能用——而且次数有限，所以每一次使用都是一个抉择。",
    ["Mud big ogre. Me hungry. Go bash fishy. Bring Mud food. You feed Mud or Mud eat you."] = "泥巴大食人魔。我饿。去揍鱼。给泥巴带吃的。你喂泥巴，不然泥巴吃你。",
    ["The head of the beast is ready to be taken off... with great force. You have shown every sign that you are able to help us with this final mighty blow."] = "野兽的头已经可以砍下来了……要用很大的力量。你已经展现出一切迹象，表明你能帮我们完成这最后的有力一击。",
    ["Long ago I possessed a beautiful piece of jewelry, the Tiara of the Deep. And not only was it pretty--it held great power for those with the knowledge to use it."] = "很久以前，我拥有一件美丽的珠宝，深渊之冠。它不仅漂亮——对那些懂得使用的人来说，它还拥有强大的力量。",
    ["Sergeant Bly stole from me! He said he'd only borrow it, but he stole my cherished divino-matic rod!! Without that rod how will I know where to dig new water holes??"] = "布莱中士偷了我的东西！他说他只是借用一下，可他偷走了我心爱的神圣探测杖！！没有那根杖，我怎么知道该在哪里挖新水井？？",
    ["Wha.. What happened? The last thing I remember is being captured by a group of dark iron dwarves, beaten to within an inch of my life and then thrown in here with these filthy troggs."] = "什……什么情况？我记得的最后一件事是被一群黑铁矮人抓住，被打得只剩一口气，然后和这些肮脏的穴居人一起被扔到这里。",
    ["Listen, that ring is yours, sure..."] = "听着，那枚戒指是你的，当然……",
    ["No, no, no - I'm not all of the sudden saying that the ring is mine."] = "不，不，不——我并不是突然说这枚戒指是我的。",
    ["When we fled Gnomeregan, we left so much data behind! Vitally important data! I need the data on a prismatic punch card, from a Matrix Punchograph 3005-D high security terminal, deep in Gnomeregan."] = "我们逃离诺莫瑞根的时候，留下了太多数据！至关重要的数据！我需要棱彩穿孔卡上的数据，它来自诺莫瑞根深处一台高度安保的终端，矩阵穿孔器3005-D。",
    ["It's terrible. We are not going to have enough parts to get our fleet of gyrodrillmatic excavationators to Dun Morogh. What we need are spare parts."] = "太糟糕了。我们的回转钻探挖掘机舰队没有足够的零件运到丹莫罗。我们需要的是备用零件。",
    ["I have cutting to do. I can't tell you what I'm going to cut, but... I need myself a blade. A certain blade... Some people call it a sword. I call it a swing blade."] = "我有东西要切。我不能告诉你我要切什么，但是……我需要一把刀刃。一把特定的刀刃……有人管它叫剑。我管它叫挥舞刀刃。",
    ["Gnome technology - two years ago its most common use was as a punch line. Times certainly have changed. Now they've got a new rig built that's better than all our shredder models combined."] = "侏儒科技——两年前它最常见的用途是当笑料。时代确实变了。现在他们造出了一套新装置，比我们所有的伐木机型号加起来都强。",
    ["My philosophy on leatherworking is that the work must be the best quality possible - no compromises. Anyone who says that quality doesn't matter is trying to sell you ocean-front property in Dun Morogh!"] = "我对制皮的理念是，作品必须是最高品质——绝不妥协。任何说品质不重要的人，都是想把丹莫罗的海景地产卖给你！",
    ["I take pride in my leather work, and I feel it shows; quality should never be compromised. Anyone who says that quality doesn't matter would also have you believe that the earth does not keep secrets!"] = "我为我的制皮手艺感到自豪，我觉得这一点看得出来；品质绝不应妥协。任何说品质不重要的人，也会让你相信大地不保守秘密！",
    ["\"Here you go, the power source is safely removed and the data is preserved. Well, safe journeys and all that."] = "“给你，能源已安全取出，数据也保存下来了。好了，一路平安之类的。",
    ["The gnome's voice crackles once again from the robot: \"I need to move OOX-17/TN to an open, safe place so it can begin a lengthy take-off procedure."] = "侏儒的声音又从机器人里噼啪作响地传出：“我需要把OOX-17/TN移到一个开阔安全的地方，这样它才能开始漫长的起飞程序。",
    ["The gnome's voice crackles once again from the robot: \"I need to move OOX-22/FE to an open, safe place so it can begin a lengthy take-off procedure."] = "侏儒的声音又从机器人里噼啪作响地传出：“我需要把OOX-22/FE移到一个开阔安全的地方，这样它才能开始漫长的起飞程序。",
    ["We must save Sharpbeak! Fight your way to the top of Jintha'Alor in the heart of Vilebranch territory, gain the key to Sharpbeak's cage from the vile Priestess Hexx, and then find and save Sharpbeak!"] = "我们必须救出锐喙！杀上位于邪枝领地中心的金萨阿罗之巅，从邪恶的女祭司赫克丝手中取得锐喙笼子的钥匙，然后找到并救出锐喙！",
    ["Do you think you could help me find my way back to my friend, Rockbiter? He was supposed to be watching me... But I do have a tendency to wander off now and then."] = "你觉得你能帮我找到回到我朋友石咬那里的路吗？他本来应该看着我的……不过我确实有时会到处乱跑的倾向。",
    ["I just arrived here in Feralas, and I've heard that the Gordunni Ogres that inhabit the wilds here have some interesting minerals. Who knows what they are up to, but they sure are protective of that stuff!"] = "我刚到菲拉斯，听说住在这片荒野里的戈杜尼食人魔拥有一些有趣的矿物。谁知道他们在打什么主意，但他们对那东西可保护得紧呢！",
    ["Before you take rest, speak to Tok'Kar again. While you were gone I believe he finished a few weapons. For your help here, he would offer one of them to you."] = "在你休息之前，再和托卡谈谈。你不在的时候，我想他完成了几件武器。为了感谢你在这里的帮助，他想把其中一件送给你。",
    ["There's a high demand for the succulent taste of crawler meat among my customers; especially the meat from the monstrous crawlers."] = "我的顾客对爬行者肉的鲜美滋味需求很大，尤其是巨型爬行者的肉。",
    ["Imbuing the muisek into the weapons is a difficult process. Now that I have all of the required materials and the muisek of the creatures that you captured, I may begin."] = "把穆塞克灌注进武器是一个困难的过程。现在我已经备齐了所有必需的材料，以及你捕获的生物的穆塞克，我可以开始了。",
    ["So, the time is now then? I appreciate your efforts, and if the situation does not lend itself, then allow me to thank you now for everything you've done for me and my family."] = "所以，现在就是时候了吗？我感谢你的努力，如果情况不允许的话，那就让我现在感谢你为我和我家人所做的一切。",
    ["Black dragons kill many ogre. Kill Tharg's wife."] = "黑龙杀很多食人魔。杀塔格的老婆。",
    ["For all the work that you have done, you deserve to be well rewarded. Return to Delgren and tell him that Athrikus Narassin lies stilled by your hand, and the Cult of the Dark Strand is beaten and scattered."] = "为你所做的一切，你值得获得丰厚的奖赏。回到德尔格伦那里，告诉他阿瑟里库斯·纳拉辛已在你手下安息，黑暗之链教团已被击败并溃散。",
    ["A while ago, I had an incident with the Shadowforge Dwarves. They brought me to Angor Fortress to study two types of strange stones from Uldaman."] = "不久前，我和影炉矮人发生了一次冲突。他们把我带到安格尔要塞，研究来自奥达曼的两种奇怪石头。",
    ["The Druids of the Fang broke from Cenarius and let the Emerald Nightmare into the Wailing Caverns. These were theirs."] = "尖牙德鲁伊背离了塞纳留斯，把翡翠梦魇放进了哀嚎洞穴。这些是属于他们的。",
    ["The spiders of the Searing Gorge are an invaluable source of shadow silk. As you know, shadow silk is highly sought after by the artisans of our trade."] = "灼热峡谷的蜘蛛是暗影丝绸的宝贵来源。如你所知，暗影丝绸深受我们行业工匠的追捧。",
    ["They call themselves the Undermarket: Cutthroat traders that will sell, move, trade and do just about anything for the right price. It gets worse."] = "他们自称“地下市场”：只要价钱合适，就会买卖、转运、交易，几乎什么都干的亡命商人。事情还在变糟。",
    ["A colleague in Kalimdor, Apothecary Helbrim, is researching the effects of Lordaeron toxins on the beasts of Kalimdor. He would be very interested in a sample of the wolf hearts Renferrel sent me."] = "我在卡利姆多的一位同事，药剂师赫尔布林，正在研究洛丹伦毒素对卡利姆多野兽的影响。他会对伦费雷尔寄给我的狼心样本非常感兴趣。",
    ["This scroll is from that scheming dryad Rynthariel, Keymaster of the Talon Den on Stonetalon Peak. She'll not be making any more contact with the messenger you looted this from, heh, but we must stand our ground here."] = "这卷轴来自那个诡计多端的树妖琳塞丽尔，石爪峰利爪巢穴的钥匙守护者。她不会再和你从他身上搜出这个的信使联系了，嘿，不过我们必须在这里坚守阵地。",
    ["This shard holds great secrets; it is the pure essence of the Emerald Dream. However, what I see in this shard is not a dream; one would call this sort of a vision a nightmare."] = "这块碎片蕴含着巨大的秘密；它是翡翠梦境的纯粹精华。然而，我在这块碎片中看到的不是梦；人们会把这种幻象称为噩梦。",
    ["Please, take from this a relic of old. We no longer have a use for the item. May it serve you well in your fight against the legion."] = "请从中拿走一件古老的圣物。我们已经用不着这件东西了。愿它在你对抗军团的战斗中好好为你效力。",
    ["the creation of each weapon will take some time. Additionally, you may only use the power of the Felcurse once per three minutes. Its weakening properties against Razelikh the Defiler and his minions may be variable in duration."] = "每件武器的制作都需要一些时间。此外，邪能诅咒的力量每三分钟只能使用一次。它对污染者拉泽利克及其爪牙的削弱效果，持续时间可能各不相同。",
    ["Onyxia's brood has been scattered across the Dragonmurk. It is imperative that no more whelps be permitted to hatch. Make haste to Wyrmbog in the south of Dustwallow Marsh."] = "奥妮克希亚的子嗣已散布在龙雾之地。绝不能再让更多的雏龙孵化。赶紧前往尘泥沼泽南边的龙窝沼泽。",
    ["Big dragons come and make fire at old home. Me smart ogre."] = "大龙来，在老家喷火。我聪明食人魔。",
    ["Out here in the wilderness, Kindal and I have meager means to reward your help, but we don't want you to feel unappreciated. Take my signet ring."] = "在这荒野里，金达尔和我没什么像样的东西来酬谢你的帮助，但我们不想让你觉得没有被感激。收下我的印章戒指。",
    ["Tymor didn't give me anything to pay you with, so I suggest you take it up with him when you get back to Ironforge. I'm sure he'll still be in his place in the Mystic Ward."] = "泰莫没给我任何东西来付你报酬，所以我建议你回到铁炉堡后直接去找他。我相信他还在神秘区他的老地方。",
    ["Return to Belgrom in Orgrimmar. He will want to see her head for himself! We'll return there shortly. Ah, this is indeed a good day. Thank you for your help."] = "回到奥格瑞玛的贝尔格罗姆那里。他会想亲眼看看她的头颅！我们很快也会回到那里。啊，今天真是个好日子。谢谢你的帮助。",
    ["It... It... It was all a trap. Forgive... me. Kill the bastard... Kill him for us... for Thorius."] = "这……这……这全是个陷阱。原谅……我。杀了那个混蛋……为我们杀了他……为索里乌斯。",
    ["Will you assist me, mortal? Will you find the prayer to Elune? As I stated, the prayer was etched onto a golden tablet. One of these idol worshipping scoundrels must have it on their person."] = "你愿意帮助我吗，凡人？你愿意找到向艾露恩的祈祷文吗？就像我说的，祈祷文刻在一块金色石板上。这些崇拜偶像的恶棍中，一定有人随身带着它。",
    ["Master Mazen's directions were quite clear: Deliver a very important essay to Watcher Mahar Ba in Nethergarde Keep. But I had never been to the Blasted Lands before!"] = "马森大师的指示非常明确：把一篇非常重要的论文交给守卫者玛哈尔·巴，他在守望堡。但我从来没去过诅咒之地！",
    ["Now it is time to capture the essence of the avatar of Hakkar. Take the Egg of Hakkar to the Sanctum of the Fallen God in the Sunken Temple in Azeroth."] = "现在是时候捕获哈卡的化身的精华了。把哈卡之卵带到艾泽拉斯沉没的神庙里堕落之神的圣殿。",
    ["Razelikh's lair is atop the highest mountain in the Blasted Lands. The only way to the lair is through the use of the teleport runes near the mountain."] = "拉泽利克的巢穴位于诅咒之地最高的山顶上。通往巢穴的唯一道路是使用山附近的传送符文。",
    ["My clanmate, Mura Runetotem, traveled to Silverpine so that she might aid our undead allies. Silverpine is an ailing forest, a dying forest, and it was Mura's hope to bring it new life."] = "我的族人穆拉·符文图腾前往银松森林，希望能帮助我们的亡灵盟友。银松森林是一片病态的森林，一片垂死的森林，穆拉希望给它带来新生。",
    ["In the Barrens lies a horrid mess of tangled vines called Razorfen Downs. While our first observations of this place revealed little threat, our recent findings are much more serious..."] = "在贫瘠之地有一片可怕的纠缠藤蔓，叫做剃刀高地。虽然我们最初的观察显示这里几乎没有威胁，但我们最近的发现严重得多……",
    ["I'm a scientist, but also a treasure hunter at heart! Long ago, when trolls used to occupy this land, they created large amounts of ornaments modeled after Gahz'rilla, a hydra they worshipped as a deity."] = "我是一名科学家，但骨子里也是个寻宝猎人！很久以前，当巨魔占据这片土地时，他们制作了大量以加兹瑞拉为原型的饰品，那是一头他们当作神灵崇拜的多头蛇。",
    ["A like you must get pretty hungry out here in The Barrens. Me, I'm starving all day long. Tell you what, I'll fix you up a nice stew. Just need a few dig rats."] = "像你这样的人在贫瘠之地一定很容易饿吧。我呢，整天都饿得慌。这样吧，我给你做一锅美味的炖菜。只需要几只挖掘鼠。",
    ["It has become obvious that we cannot ensure that Blacklash and Hematus will remain imprisoned in Lethlor."] = "很明显，我们无法保证黑鞭和海马图斯会一直被囚禁在雷索洛。",
    ["I once served the Scarlet Crusade with honor, loyalty and pride. I believed their cause to be a noble one: to rid Azeroth of the undead."] = "我曾经带着荣誉、忠诚和自豪为血色十字军效力。我曾相信他们的事业是高尚的：把亡灵从艾泽拉斯清除出去。",
    ["I used to sail a ship from here all the way to Ratchet, in Kalimdor. I was a successful captain with a sterling reputation. Until... Those cursed sea giants ruined me!"] = "我以前驾着船从这里一路航行到卡利姆多的棘齿城。我是一位成功的船长，名声卓著。直到……那些该死的海巨人毁了我！",
    ["I think I can fix the samophlange, but I'm going to need the user's manual first."] = "我想我能修好萨莫兰吉，不过我首先需要用户手册。",
    ["General Shandris Feathermoon would like to speak with you personally."] = "将军莎恩迪丝·羽月想亲自和你谈谈。",
    ["What?! Ah, so I did mention a bounty, didn't I? Well, that'll teach me to open my mouth, won't it? You did the work, so I suppose it is only right you reap the greatest reward from it."] = "什么？！啊，我确实提过赏金，是吗？嗯，这下我该学会管住嘴了，对吧？活是你干的，所以我想你理应获得最大的回报。",
    ["In Un'Goro Crater there be raptors with deadly claws. Some of those raptors sometimes have white claws instead of ones black like death."] = "在安戈洛环形山，有长着致命利爪的迅猛龙。其中一些迅猛龙的爪子有时是白色的，而不是像死亡一样的黑色。",
    ["My brother Ribbly has always been a drain to his family, taking our money and wasting it on one scheme after another."] = "我弟弟里布利一直是家里的拖累，拿我们的钱浪费在一个又一个计划上。",
    ["My physical being ceased functioning after an hour of this torture. The beast then ripped my wedding nose-ring off of my face and stuck it on his finger."] = "这样的折磨持续了一个小时后，我的肉体停止了运作。随后那头野兽从我脸上扯下我的结婚鼻环，戴在了它自己的手指上。",
    ["your help has been immeasurable. The time will come, no doubt, when I'll ask for your assistance against the silithid once more."] = "你的帮助是无法估量的。毫无疑问，总有一天，我会再次请求你协助对抗异种虫族。",
    ["Felwood was once a peaceful and serene land... Until the legion took hold. The infernals, destruction, chaos... The skull of Gul'dan ensured that none were spared here."] = "费伍德曾经是一片平静安宁的土地……直到军团占领了它。地狱火、毁灭、混乱……古尔丹的头骨确保这里没有谁能幸免。",
    ["A second encampment of satyrs threatens the land of Felwood towards the north, led by the cruel Xavaric. The vile betrayers and tricksters feed upon the corruption of the native creatures of Felwood."] = "第二个萨特营地威胁着北边的费伍德，由残酷的萨瓦里克领导。这些邪恶的叛徒和骗子以费伍德本地生物的腐化为食。",
    ["This will be the most difficult part because there is some complexity to the plan. To the north of here, you will find a small trail into the mountains."] = "这将是最困难的部分，因为计划有些复杂。在这里的北边，你会发现一条通往山里的小径。",
    ["Let me to be frank with you. I'm interested - nay, concerned with why the Arch Druid in Darnassus is using the name of the Cenarion Circle as well as the Circle's resources to procure vast amounts of morrowgrain."] = "让我坦率地跟你说。我很感兴趣——不，是担忧——为什么达纳苏斯的大德鲁伊要使用塞纳里奥议会的名义和议会的资源，去采购大量的晨谷。",
    ["I finally remember now... I did come here to fight Blazerunner. I was on a journey, and this was to be the last step. But I am no longer the hero..."] = "我现在终于想起来了……我确实是来这里与烈焰奔行者战斗的。我正在旅途中，这应该是最后一步。但我不再是英雄了……",
    ["You'd think that being chief digger for Marshal Expeditions means I like digging. There might be worse things to do in this world... but none really leap to mind."] = "你会以为当马歇尔探险队的首席挖掘工就意味着我喜欢挖掘。这世上也许有更糟糕的事……但我一时还真想不出来。",
    ["Ugh... It's so hot... I was exploring this area, when all of a sudden, the heat just became unbearable. I must be suffering from heat exhaustion."] = "呃……好热……我正在探索这片区域，突然间热得受不了了。我一定是中暑了。",
    ["I'm making a flying machine! I got stranded here, and I'm absolutely horrible at finding my way around. I'd take a gryphon or wind rider back to Gadgetzan, but those beasts just scare me to death."] = "我在制造一台飞行机器！我被困在这里了，而且我特别不擅长认路。我本可以乘狮鹫或风骑士回加基森，但那些野兽吓死我了。",
    ["The Dark Iron dwarves, led by the villain Hurley Blackbreath, stole one of the Thunderbrew's best recipes, Thunderbrew Lager. The villains! They don't deserve such a fine brew!, I have a tough task for you."] = "黑铁矮人在恶棍赫利·黑息的带领下，偷走了雷酒家族最好的配方之一，雷酒拉格啤酒。这些恶棍！他们不配拥有这样的好酒！我有一项艰巨的任务要交给你。",
    ["Bolvar is a fool. I was gathering his precious 'proof' so that I could shove it down his throat. He is a blind buffoon. Proof stands two feet away from him and he does not see."] = "博尔瓦是个傻瓜。我一直在收集他珍贵的“证据”，好把它塞进他的喉咙里。他是个瞎眼的蠢货。证据就在他两英尺开外，他却看不见。",
    ["We need to get out of here. Help me get my gear back from the supply area and free my friends. If we make it out of here, you are to proceed to Morgan's Vigil and speak with Marshal Maxwell."] = "我们得离开这里。帮我从补给区拿回我的装备，并救出我的朋友。如果我们能逃出去，你就前往摩根的岗哨，和元帅麦克斯韦尔谈谈。",
    ["As if crashing into the Loch wasn't bad enough, troggs from the nearby island attacked me and stole my tools and special Blastenheimer Blastencapper explosives."] = "撞进湖里已经够糟了，附近岛屿上的穴居人又攻击了我，偷走了我的工具和特制的布拉斯滕海默爆破炸药。",
    ["I look at my undeath as a malady. An illness that merely requires treatment; however, it is also a great blessing for the Argent Dawn. What better vessel to smite the heathens of the Scourge than through the undead?"] = "我把自己的不死状态看作一种病。一种只需要治疗的疾病；然而，这对银色黎明也是一种巨大的福祉。还有什么比亡灵更适合作为容器去打击天灾军团的异教徒呢？",
    ["I draw my power - my will to continue living and breathing - from the unmitigated hatred I have for the Scourge and all that they have done."] = "我的力量——我继续活着和呼吸的意志——来自我对天灾军团及其所作所为的无尽仇恨。",
    ["Take this letter back to Stormwind and let Malin know that Kryten an' I'll be home soon. He'll reward you well for helping us here, of that I've no doubt."] = "把这封信带回暴风城，告诉马林，克莱顿和我很快就会回家。他会好好奖励你在这里帮助我们的，这一点我毫不怀疑。",
    ["We've learned that a source of furbolg corruption is from the satyr. They hold sway via talismans that they channel magic through. If the furbolg have a chance at salvation, we must lure out the satyr corruptor and take that talisman!"] = "我们得知熊怪腐化的一个来源是萨特。他们通过护符施加影响，魔法经由这些护符导出。如果熊怪还有获救的机会，我们必须引出萨特腐化者并夺取那枚护符！",
    ["I was on my way to Maestra's Post to meet Liladris Moonriver, but I decided to stop here and take a short nap. Ever since I awoke from the emerald dream, I have been so sleepy..."] = "我正要去马埃斯特拉哨站见莉拉德里斯·月河，但我决定在这里停一下，小睡片刻。自从我从翡翠梦境醒来，我就一直这么困……",
    ["The moonwell water has revealed that embedded inside the crystal are a few small fragments of bone, as well as half of a jawbone."] = "月亮井的水显示，水晶里嵌着几小块骨头碎片，还有半块下颌骨。",
    ["That beached creature is not an isolated incident here in Darkshore. There are more along the coastline and even in the water."] = "那只搁浅的生物在黑海岸并非个例。沿海岸线甚至水里还有更多。",
    ["I love crab. Crabs are the fruit of the sea! You can bake it, barbecue it, boil it, and broil it. They're pan fried, deep fried, and stir fried."] = "我爱吃螃蟹。螃蟹是海里的水果！可以烤、可以烧烤、可以煮、可以炙。有煎的、油炸的、爆炒的。",
    ["I've seen Kinelory look way worse after a night in the tavern than she does now. You obviously did a good job protecting her."] = "我见过基内洛莉在酒馆过了一夜后比现在糟糕得多的样子。你显然把她保护得很好。",
    ["you have served us well in the past, so I now entrust to you an important mission. The Grimtotem Clan is up to something secretive. Three agents of unknown origin were seen visiting the Grimtotem over the recent weeks."] = "你过去对我们很有帮助，所以现在我把一项重要的任务交给你。恐怖图腾氏族正在暗中密谋。最近几周，有三名来历不明的密探被人看到拜访恐怖图腾。",
    ["But, there may be more centaur than I thought, I ask you, to fight with me against these vile assassins."] = "但是，也许半人马比我想象的要多，我请求你与我一起对抗这些卑劣的刺客。",
    ["Take this refined and purified Incendia powder to Thousand Needles and toss it on the sacred fire of life. It is located in the Darkcloud Pinnacle on an isolated needle where they bury their dead."] = "把这份提炼并净化过的燃烧粉末带到千针石林，把它扔进神圣的生命之火中。它位于黑云峰，在一根偏僻的石针上，那是他们埋葬死者的地方。",
    ["Arnak thinks we're going to be married... but after I declined his offer he came back that night and kidnapped me. My brother tried to stop him, but Arnak was too strong."] = "阿尔纳克以为我们会结婚……可我拒绝了他的求婚，他当晚就回来把我绑走了。我哥哥想阻止他，可阿尔纳克太强了。",
    ["Wanted: Arnak Grimtotem Arnak the outcast is wanted for the heinous crimes of murder and kidnapping. Handsome rewards will be given to those brave enough to bring this criminal to justice."] = "通缉：阿尔纳克·恐怖图腾。被放逐者阿尔纳克因谋杀和绑架等恶行遭到通缉。凡有勇气将这名罪犯绳之以法者，将获得丰厚的赏金。",
    ["You have the look of a fisherman! I love to fish - been fishing all my life. The best bait to use is soft-shelled clam meat; the fish just can't resist, you know what I mean?"] = "你有渔夫的模样！我喜欢钓鱼——钓了一辈子鱼。最好的鱼饵是软壳蛤蜊肉；鱼根本抵挡不住，你懂我的意思吧？",
    ["Under normal circumstances, Rigger and I would lead our kodo past the Kolkar Centaur. Every now and then we hear the Centaur war drums, and when we hear those we stop."] = "通常情况下，里格和我会带着我们的科多兽从科卡尔半人马旁边经过。偶尔我们会听到半人马的战鼓声，一听到那声音我们就停下。",
    ["We're sitting on a goldmine here, I tell you - a goldmine! Kodo bones will change the world forever... I have customers making furniture, music instruments, and even blasting powder out of them."] = "我告诉你，我们坐在一座金矿上——一座金矿！科多兽的骨头将永远改变世界……我有客户用它做家具、乐器，甚至火药。",
    ["Well, the only caravan brave enough to travel these parts relies on me. Ever since I learned how to rejuvenate and control aged and dying kodos with my kodo kombobulator, the caravan owner Cork, Rigger, and I entered a partnership."] = "嗯，唯一敢在这一带旅行的商队就靠我。自从我学会用我的科多兽重振器让年老垂死的科多兽恢复活力并加以控制，商队老板科克、里格和我就结成了合伙关系。",
    ["Here is some encased ooze created from the Felwood samples you recovered. Take the case to Un'Goro Crater and find a pure ooze... the primal variety will do nicely."] = "这是用你找回的费伍德样本制成的封装软泥。把盒子带到安戈洛环形山，找一只纯净的软泥怪……原始种类就很合适。",
    ["Before you spoke to me, I had heard of your endeavors... that you had an unyielding desire to prove yourself, that you had an exceptional ability as a, and I now know these things to be the truth."] = "在你和我说话之前，我就听说了你的事迹……说你有一种不屈不挠的证明自己的渴望，说你有非凡的能力，现在我知道这些都是真的。",
    ["You pick up the sack carefully and prepare to make your way back to Jessir Moonbow on the border of Felwood and Ashenvale. Hopefully the paladin will be given the proper respects once you've passed his remains on to his friends."] = "你小心翼翼地拿起袋子，准备返回费伍德和灰谷交界处的杰西尔·月弓那里。希望等你把圣骑士的遗骸交给他的朋友们之后，他能得到应有的尊敬。",
    ["Unfortunately, I see the only way to stop this threat to Felwood is a frontal attack. There are no other ways into Shadow Hold, and I have no means to teleport you inside."] = "不幸的是，我看唯一能阻止费伍德这场威胁的办法是正面进攻。进入暗影要塞没有其他路，我也没有办法把你传送进去。",
    ["In northern Winterspring, great cats assemble around a large landmark called Frostsaber Rock. The leader of these cats is known by the name Shy-Rotam."] = "在冬泉谷北部，大猫们聚集在一处名叫霜刃岩的大型地标周围。这些大猫的首领名叫羞怯罗坦。",
    ["While we still know very little about why the furbolg have been ingesting this strange substance, I do think it's best that we put a stop to it before it gets out of hand."] = "虽然我们对熊怪为何一直在摄入这种奇怪的物质仍然知之甚少，但我确实认为，最好在事态失控之前阻止它。",
    ["To tell you the truth, although there are no volcanoes here in Winterspring, I believe that there are far more threatening reasons for these hot springs..."] = "说实话，虽然冬泉谷这里没有火山，但我认为这些温泉背后有更具威胁的原因……",
    ["Quite impressive. The crystal of Zin-Malor can never be returned to the temple which, as you know, lies in ruin. But I believe that your effort to undo the evil of the past should not go unrewarded."] = "相当令人印象深刻。辛玛洛之晶永远无法归还神殿，而你也知道，神殿已成废墟。但我认为，你为消除过去的邪恶所做的努力不该没有回报。",
    ["The lifeless hand of the tauren druid clutches a surprisingly healthy looking oaken branch. Examining the branch reveals glyphs of a druidic nature carved into the bark."] = "牛头人德鲁伊那毫无生气的手紧握着一根看上去出奇健康的橡木树枝。检查树枝，你发现树皮上刻着德鲁伊风格的符文。",
    ["Tampering of the timeline by a sinister force - most likely the Scourge - has occurred in Andorhal! I can try to keep the passage of time here intact and mend what has been damaged, but I'll need your help to do so uninterrupted."] = "安多哈尔的时间线被一股邪恶力量——很可能是天灾军团——篡改了！我可以尝试保持这里时间流逝的完整，并修复被损坏的部分，但我需要你的帮助才能不受打扰地完成。",
    ["In Timbermaw, we are content. We do not like strangers. This is good for us, but it is bad for trade. Not long ago, a rare night elf friend came to Timbermaw and she wore a runecloth cloak."] = "在木喉，我们很满足。我们不喜欢陌生人。这对我们有好处，但对贸易不利。不久前，一位难得的暗夜精灵朋友来到木喉，她穿着一件符文布斗篷。",
    ["Daddy told me to give you this key. He said it opens a chest out back behind the house. He also wanted me to thank you. Did you do a favor for him?"] = "爸爸让我把这把钥匙给你。他说它能打开房子后面的一只箱子。他还想让我谢谢你。你是不是帮过他的忙？",
    ["Ok, everything is prepared and packed and ready for transport! Good luck in your journey, and make sure you tell Tinkee that she owes me!"] = "好了，一切都准备好、打包好，可以运走了！祝你旅途顺利，一定要告诉廷克，她欠我的！",
    ["There's a valley to the southeast, the Valley of Bones, haunted by Magram ghosts. Sounds scary, doesn't it? Well think how scary it is to the Magram!"] = "东南方有一座山谷，白骨谷，有玛格拉姆的幽灵出没。听起来很吓人，对吧？那你想想，对玛格拉姆来说有多吓人！",
    ["The amount of salve made out of the reagents you brought me is good enough for ten doses. While I work with the village to try and make some more salve, I'd like for you to help us get a head start."] = "用你带来的材料制成的药膏足够用十次。我与村子一起努力制作更多药膏的时候，我希望你能帮我们抢先一步。",
    ["You have completed the necessary lessons all young druids are taught before they can adopt an aquatic aspect. Go now back to your trainer, Mathrengyl Bearwalker, in Darnassus."] = "你已完成所有年轻德鲁伊在采用水生形态之前必须学习的课程。现在回到你的训练师达纳苏斯的马瑟伦吉尔·熊行者那里去吧。",
    ["That's fascinating! I have always wondered about the truth... Well, you must share this knowledge, definitely! Go to Arch Druid Fandral Staghelm right away -- you'll find him in Darnassus, in the Cenarion Circle."] = "太迷人了！我一直都想知道真相……嗯，你必须分享这个知识，当然！马上去找大德鲁伊范达尔·鹿盔——你会在达纳苏斯的塞纳里奥议会找到他。",
    ["The Earthen Ring is a shamanistic group dedicated to studying and preserving the elements. They have forgotten more about crazy old gods, ancient legends and lore than most scholars will ever know."] = "大地之环是致力于研究和保护元素的萨满团体。他们遗忘的关于疯狂的上古之神、古老传说和典故的东西，比大多数学者一辈子能知道的还要多。",
    ["Just recently, a large band of nomadic ogres arrived in Tanaris. South of here, they have taken over a large area of the desert and formed a compound."] = "就在最近，一大群游牧食人魔来到了塔纳利斯。在这里的南边，他们占据了沙漠里的一大片区域，建起了营地。",
    ["I just picked up this shredder from Ratchet and I was on my way back to the Warsong Lumber Camp, where I am supposed to be on duty."] = "我刚从棘齿城取了这台伐木机，正在回战歌伐木场的路上，我应该在那里值班。",
    ["I entrust you with the Gem of the Serpent. Place this gem on the Serpent Statue's hand on Ranazjar Isle, a small island northwest of here. Placing it will summon the one who protects the Book of the Ancients."] = "我把蛇之宝石托付给你。把这块宝石放在拉纳兹贾岛上蛇像的手里，那是这里西北方的一座小岛。放上去就会召唤出守护上古之书的存在。",
    ["Behold - the Hand of Iruxos. A gruesome sight indeed. You must possess it if the demon portals at Mannoroc Coven are to be banished... which is what I now ask you to do."] = "看——伊鲁索斯之手。确实是一幅可怕的景象。如果要驱逐玛诺洛克巢穴的恶魔传送门，你就必须拥有它……这就是我现在请你做的事。",
    ["The defeated water elemental has left behind a strange water globe. You surmise that the object somehow fed the beast energy. Inside the globe, a putrid-looking form of water sloshes about."] = "被击败的水元素留下了一颗奇怪的水球。你推测这东西以某种方式为野兽提供了能量。水球里面，有一团看上去腐臭的水在晃动。",
    ["Hey!! Come here! My raiders and I are about to attack the Silverwing Outpost to the west. Our target is its leader, Duriel Moonfire. Scouts report the outpost is defended heavily with sentinels and warriors."] = "嘿！！过来！我和我的劫掠者们即将攻击西边的银翼要塞。我们的目标是它的首领，杜里尔·月火。斥候报告说，这座哨站有哨兵和战士严密防守。",
    ["Warning: Proceed into Sishir Canyon west of here at your own risk. Besseleth and her eight-legged children of the forest have claimed this canyon as their webbed lair."] = "警告：进入此地以西的希希尔峡谷，后果自负。贝瑟蕾丝和她八条腿的森林之子已把这座峡谷据为自己的蛛网巢穴。",
    ["We are in short supply of a few items at the Warsong lumber camp!"] = "战歌伐木场缺少几样东西！",
    ["As you have seen, though the land is in pain, the cycle of life is a powerful thing. Now we must do our part help it along. You must plant these seeds at the center of the destruction, to the west, in the Charred Vale."] = "正如你所见，虽然这片土地在痛苦中，但生命的循环是强大的。现在我们必须尽自己的一份力来推动它。你必须把这些种子种在毁灭的中心，西边的焦炭谷。",
    ["Limiting the number of Bloodfury Harpies will not be enough. The only true cure for their disease would be to slay their leader, Bloodfury Ripper!"] = "限制血怒鹰身人的数量是不够的。治愈她们疾病的唯一真正办法，就是杀死她们的首领，血怒撕裂者！",
    ["Yes, imbecile, perhaps you are ready for a more involved set of missions. The albino demon bat, Duskwing, roams the countryside just north of here."] = "是的，蠢货，也许你已经准备好接受一套更复杂的任务了。白化恶魔蝙蝠，暗翼，在这里正北边的乡间游荡。",
    ["Past the Argent Dawn encampment of Light's Hope and west of Northdale, you will find the corpulent maggot beast, Borelgore. I've lost entire regiments to that monster."] = "经过银色黎明的希望之光营地，在北谷以西，你会找到那头肥胖的蛆虫野兽，博雷戈尔。我有整整几个团毁在那头怪物手里。",
    ["another tribe of Furbolgs, the Foulweald, live southeast of Astranaar. They are not as many as the Thistlefur, but their ferocity poses a future threat."] = "另一个熊怪部落，污染者部落，住在阿斯特兰纳东南面。他们不像荆棘毛那么多，但他们的凶猛构成了未来的威胁。",
    ["Malcin claims he is outside Razorfen Downs. This ambassador must be slain--his mission a failure in the eyes of the Lich King."] = "马尔辛声称自己在剃刀高地外面。这位大使必须被杀死——他的任务在巫妖王眼中已经失败。",
    ["A pit lord left behind when the Legion's invasion collapsed, still holding the Tainted Scar where the Dark Portal's blast burned the land."] = "军团入侵崩溃后被遗留下来的一名深渊领主，仍然守着黑暗之门爆炸烧焦土地所留下的污染伤疤。",
    ["Ragnaros wielded this hammer as the Firelord. Reforging it means taking the Eye of Sulfuras from Ragnaros himself and setting it into the Sulfuron Hammer."] = "拉格纳罗斯作为火焰之王时曾挥舞这把锤子。重铸它意味着要从拉格纳罗斯本人手中取走萨弗拉斯之眼，并把它镶嵌到萨弗隆锤上。",
    ["While you were gathering the supplies, I had some of my people handle marking the Scourge buildings we need demolished. Here's the plan: I'm going to give you ten sticks of my special compound."] = "你收集补给的时候，我让我的一些人负责标记我们需要拆除的天灾军团建筑。计划是这样的：我要给你十根我的特制炸药。",
    ["This Twilight's Hammer follower cannot be allowed to complete his plan. The Twilight's Hammer do not understand the spirits of nature. They believe in the Old Gods--creatures of chaos and destruction that were long ago defeated."] = "这个暮光之锤的追随者不能被允许完成他的计划。暮光之锤不了解自然之灵。他们相信的是上古之神——很久以前就被击败的混乱与毁灭的生物。",
    ["A princess of the earth elementals and the reason Maraudon is poisoned -- she holds the body of Zaetar, her demigod consort, at its heart."] = "大地元素的公主，也是玛拉顿被毒化的原因——她的核心处守着她的半神配偶扎埃塔尔的遗体。",
    ["Deep in Maraudon lives an evil creature of chaos--Princess Theradras is an elemental force of earth related to the Old Gods. Ages ago, she and Zaetar, first son of Cenarius, began a relationship."] = "在玛拉顿深处住着一个邪恶的混乱生物——瑟拉德拉斯公主，是与上古之神有关的大地元素之力。很久以前，她和塞纳留斯的长子扎埃塔尔开始了一段关系。",
    ["The crystal caverns of Terramok lie to the west, deep within Maraudon... It is an ancient place with much history. And I am looking to get my hands on some of it."] = "特拉莫克的水晶洞窟在西边，深藏在玛拉顿之中……那是一个历史悠久的古老之地。我想弄到其中的一些东西。",
    ["A satyr known as Vyletongue has corrupted the caverns of Maraudon, stunting the growth of many of the plants inside. Take this vial."] = "一个名叫邪舌的萨特腐化了玛拉顿的洞窟，阻碍了里面许多植物的生长。拿着这个小瓶。",
    ["You have earned reverence among the Guard. Present your insignia!"] = "你在守卫中赢得了崇敬。出示你的徽记！",
    ["Rise and be honored! Present your insignia."] = "起身接受荣耀！出示你的徽记。",
    ["Your time has come again. You have earned a new ranking and as such, a new insignia denoting this rise in stature."] = "你的时刻又到了。你获得了新的军衔，因此也获得了标志这一地位提升的新徽记。",
    ["I had not expected you to return. Alas, you have proven yourself a brave and honorable soldier of the Frostwolf."] = "我没想到你会回来。唉，你已证明自己是霜狼的一名勇敢而光荣的战士。",
    ["Your radiate command and power, shaman. Exalted in the eyes of Frostwolf - the enemy cowers at the mention of your name."] = "你散发着指挥与力量的气息，萨满。在霜狼眼中受到崇尚——敌人一听到你的名字就瑟瑟发抖。",
    ["You have earned the Eye of Command. Present your insignia, Commander."] = "你已赢得了统御之眼。出示你的徽记，指挥官。",
    ["your services to the Warlords surpassed all we could expect from the denizens of this world. We do not understand your people's notions of gratitude, or rewarding good works, but in this case..."] = "你为战争领主们提供的服务超出了我们对这个世界居民的一切期望。我们不理解你们种族对感谢或奖赏善行的观念，但这一次……",
    ["Anyway, you should check back with me relatively soon... that is if you want to know what was in here. As soon as I find out what it is, and if it's indeed a book, I'd be happy to share that information with you."] = "不管怎样，你应该很快回来找我……如果你想知道里面是什么的话。一旦我弄清楚它是什么，如果它确实是一本书，我很乐意与你分享这些信息。",
    ["Overlord Runthak awaits your arrival in the Valley of Strength. Do not keep your public waiting, hero."] = "大酋长伦萨克正在力量谷等候你的到来。别让你的观众久等，英雄。",
    ["The Firelord, one of the four Elemental Lords, bound to the Elemental Plane until the Dark Iron dwarves summoned him under Blackrock Mountain. The summoning cracked the mountain open and made the Molten Core."] = "火焰之王，四大元素领主之一，被束缚在元素位面，直到黑铁矮人在黑石山下将他召唤出来。这次召唤使山体裂开，形成了熔火之心。",
    ["A hound handler of Ragnaros's court, who curses healing shut before the fighting starts."] = "拉格纳罗斯宫廷里的猎犬驯养者，在战斗开始之前就诅咒治疗失效。",
    ["Avast Lubber! Bring me 12 trinkets of the Arena Master and then ye shall be a Grandmaster of the Gurubashi Arena!"] = "喂，旱鸭子！给我带来12个竞技场大师饰品，你就是古拉巴什竞技场的宗师了！",
    ["You've done doubly well in addressing the threat that the Zukk'ash insects pose to Camp Mojache. The threat these things pose is far from over, and I'd like to ask you for one last task on behalf of the Horde."] = "你在处理祖卡什昆虫对莫沙彻营地的威胁上做得加倍出色。这些东西构成的威胁远未结束，我想代表部落请你完成最后一项任务。",
    ["When doing this though, be sure to save me the water elemental cores!"] = "这么做的时候，一定要给我留下水元素之核！",
    ["I have a lead on an even BETTER source of hides, if that's even possible to believe! In the northern parts of Feralas - deep within Rage Scar Hold - are another throng of yetis."] = "我有一条更好的皮革来源的线索，如果这真能让人相信的话！在菲拉斯北部——深入暴怒伤疤要塞——还有另一群雪人。",
    ["The invading Stormpike are not the only threat in the region, soldier. The war in the Valley is waged on two fronts. The cannibal Winterax trolls also vie for power."] = "入侵的雷矛并不是这一地区唯一的威胁，士兵。山谷里的战争在两条战线上展开。食人的冬斧巨魔也在争夺权力。",
    ["Return to my mate, Primal Torntusk at Revantusk Village. Tell her that I am coming home! She is sure to reward you."] = "回到雷矛村我的伴侣，原始者断牙那里。告诉她我要回家了！她一定会奖赏你的。",
    ["Like many in our village, I too have lost a loved one to the wilds. Alas, it was my twin brother Malkhor - taken in the same raid as Torntusk's mate by the Vilebranch."] = "和我们村里的许多人一样，我也因荒野失去了一位挚爱的人。唉，那是我的双胞胎兄弟马尔科尔——和断牙的伴侣在同一次袭击中被邪枝部落抓走了。",
    ["You take this, mon. You take this to Aerie Peak, dead center of town by the well. You plant it! Drive it right into the ground! Show those dwarves that troll mean business!"] = "你拿着这个，伙计。把这个带到鹰巢山，镇子正中央的井边。你把它种下去！直接插进地里！让那些矮人看看巨魔是认真的！",
    ["With the loss of Guard Captain Malkhor, the position of Guard Captain of Revantusk is once again open."] = "随着卫队长马尔科尔的离去，雷矛卫队长的职位再度空缺。",
    ["By order of Primal Torntusk, Vile Priestess Hexx and her minions are to be brought to justice! A grand reward is offered for any that slay the Vile Priestess Hexx and all of her Aman'zasi elite guard."] = "奉原始者断牙之命，邪恶的女祭司赫克丝及其爪牙必须被绳之以法！凡杀死邪恶的女祭司赫克丝及其所有阿曼扎西精英卫队者，将获得重赏。",
    ["The following items have been stolen: *One Dark Iron Tuyere. *One Lookout's Spyglass. A reward is being offered to individuals who find and return these pilfered items."] = "下列物品被盗：*黑铁风口一个。*瞭望者的望远镜一个。凡找到并归还这些被盗物品者将获得赏金。",
    ["By order o' 'is eminence, Overseer Oilfist, the rogue Thorium Brotherhood agent an' newly hired commander o' the Dark Iron Slag Pit crew o' the Cauldron, Overseer Maltorius, is to be killed an' 'is head brung back as proof o' the deed."] = "奉监工油拳阁下之命：叛变的瑟银兄弟会特工、刚被任命为熔炉黑铁熔渣坑工队指挥官的监工马尔托留斯必须被杀，并把他的头颅带回作为证明。",
    ["A red dragon of Alexstrasza's flight, broken by Nefarian's experiments. He asks to be killed before the corruption finishes taking him, and apologises while he fights."] = "一头阿莱克丝塔萨一族的红龙，被奈法利安的实验摧残得面目全非。他请求在腐化彻底吞没他之前被杀死，并在战斗时不断道歉。",
    ["Deathwing's son, working under Blackrock Mountain to breed the chromatic flight -- dragons carrying the blood of all five. He spent years in Stormwind's court as Lord Victor Nefarius while the work went on."] = "死亡之翼之子，在黑石山下工作，培育彩色龙群——携带全部五色龙血脉的龙。工作进行期间，他以维克多·奈法里奥勋爵的身份在暴风城宫廷中度过了多年。",
    ["One of three drakes guarding Nefarian's inner lair, and the one that heals itself off the wounds it deals."] = "守卫奈法利安内殿的三头龙之一，也是依靠自己造成的伤口来治疗自己的那一头。",
    ["Cut from the fang of one of Nefarian's drakes. Tanks wore it for the stun it shrugs off, not the numbers on it."] = "取自奈法利安一头龙的尖牙。坦克穿戴它是为了它能无视昏迷，而不是为了上面的数字。",
    ["The last of Nefarian's three drakes, and the one that simply gets angrier as the fight goes on."] = "奈法利安三头龙中的最后一头，也是在战斗中只会越来越愤怒的那一头。",
    ["The ultimate symbol of a haruspex's power is what they wear."] = "占卜师力量的终极象征就是他们的穿着。",
    ["We Zandalar know not of druidic ways; nature is to be shaped by our need, not the other way around."] = "我们赞达拉人不懂德鲁伊的方式；自然应该由我们的需要来塑造，而不是反过来。",
    ["By communion with animals and givin' them up to the spirits when needed, they give us divine guidance. In times past, the haruspex's insight and wisdom gave us an edge in the wars against the splintered tribes of the Gurubashi."] = "通过与动物沟通，并在需要时把它们献给灵魂，他们给予我们神圣的指引。在过去，占卜师的洞察和智慧让我们在对抗分裂的古拉巴什部落的战争中占了上风。",
    ["Hakkar's chief hexxer, who fights by binding pieces of his enemies' spirits and setting them loose."] = "哈卡的首席妖术师，他通过束缚敌人灵魂的碎片再将其放出来战斗。",
    ["He must be stopped! Take this sacred cord, and string through it the heads of the high priests responsible for channeling our gods' energy."] = "必须阻止他！拿着这根神圣的绳索，把负责引导我们诸神能量的高阶祭司的头颅串在上面。",
    ["My delvings into the Mosh'aru Tablets bear grim news. Hakkar's true form, the god himself, can be born again through the very egg into which you captured him."] = "我对莫沙鲁石板的研究带来了严峻的消息。哈卡的真身，神本身，可以通过你囚禁他的那枚蛋再次诞生。",
    ["One of Ysera's four green consorts, corrupted by the Emerald Nightmare and now roaming Feralas, rotting the ground it stands on."] = "伊瑟拉四位绿色配偶之一，被翡翠梦魇腐化，如今在菲拉斯游荡，所站之处土地都在腐烂。",
    ["The waters of Lake Elune'ara should dissolve the nightmares engulfing this object. Give me a moment to perform the cleansing."] = "月神湖的水应该能溶解吞噬这件物品的梦魇。给我一点时间进行净化。",
    ["A Nightmare-corrupted green dragon who splits himself into shades rather than face a fight whole."] = "一头被梦魇腐化的绿龙，他把自己分裂成暗影，而不是完整地面对战斗。",
    ["They want the impossible from me! The Steamwheedle Cartel wants me to teach the Southsea pirates a lesson."] = "他们要我做不可能的事！热砂港商会想让我教训一下南海海盗。",
    ["The terrible scorpid, Deathclasp, is believed to have retreated to the southern mountain range in the presence of increased silithid activity."] = "可怕的蝎子，死亡之钳，据信在异种虫族活动加剧的情况下撤退到了南部山脉。",
    ["We have discovered another base of operations for the Twilight's Hammer. It is called Twilight's Run; it is a cave tucked in the northeast corner of Silithus."] = "我们发现了暮光之锤的另一个行动基地。它叫暮光之径；是藏在希利苏斯东北角的一个洞穴。",
    ["I need you to venture into Hive'Regal and find what became of my dearest Natalia. This will be no easy task for you. Before you dive headlong into the maw of madness, make sure that you go back and speak with those dwarves."] = "我需要你闯入希瓦利斯，查明我最亲爱的娜塔莉亚怎么样了。这对你来说不会容易。在你一头扎进疯狂的深渊之前，一定要回去和那些矮人谈谈。",
    ["An Old God, buried under Ahn'Qiraj by the titans rather than killed. It has been whispering to the qiraji ever since, and the whole war exists because it never stopped."] = "一个上古之神，被泰坦埋葬在安其拉之下而没有杀死。从那以后它一直在向其拉虫族低语，整场战争的存在就是因为它从未停止过。",
    ["The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Cenarion Hold are more than just for show. You'd be wise to hold on to them."] = "你为塞纳里奥要塞执行战斗、后勤和战术任务所收集的徽章，可不只是用来炫耀的。你最好留着它们。",
    ["The badges you collect from performing combat, logistics and tactical assignments for Windcaller Proudhorn are more than just for show. You'd be wise to hold on to them."] = "你为风语者傲角执行战斗、后勤和战术任务所收集的徽章，可不只是用来炫耀的。你最好留着它们。",
    ["I speak of Elementium, mortal. Find and bring me Imperial Qiraji Regalia and the toxic element and I shall infuse weapons of great power."] = "我说的是源质，凡人。找到并给我带来其拉帝国徽记和毒性元素，我就能灌注出强大的武器。",
    ["The Timbermaw are the only furbolg tribe to escape the corruption. However, many other races kill furbolg blindly now, without bothering to see if they are friend or foe."] = "木喉是唯一躲过腐化的熊怪部落。然而，现在许多其他种族不分敌友地盲目杀戮熊怪。",
    ["There is a camp of Deadwood furbolgs directly to our southwest. Corruption permeates the camp, and I wish to put an end to it before they become a problem."] = "在我们的正西南有一座死木熊怪营地。腐化渗透了整个营地，我希望在他们成为问题之前终结它。",
    ["The Timbermaw tend to stay to themselves. While we do allow safe passage to those we trust, we try to avoid other furbolg tribes if at all possible."] = "木喉倾向于独处。虽然我们会让我们信任的人安全通过，但我们会尽可能避开其他熊怪部落。",
    ["The Twin Emperors... their incessant whispers are slowly taking a toll on my sanity. They mock me, knowing I cannot step further into their domain to save my brother Arygos."] = "双子皇帝……他们不停的低语正慢慢侵蚀我的理智。他们嘲弄我，知道我无法再深入他们的领地去救我的兄弟阿鲁高斯。",
    ["It is said among us that the ornate shoulder armor worn by the mortal races started as an attempt to emulate the wings of a dragon."] = "我们之间流传着一种说法：凡人种族所穿的华丽肩甲，最初是为了模仿龙的翅膀。",
    ["The most powerful qiraji wield items of such might, they'd give pause even to a dragon. Bring me the qiraji bindings of dominance and other minor components by and I'll create a set of powerful boots for you."] = "最强大的其拉所用的物品拥有强大的力量，连巨龙也会为之迟疑。把其拉的统御束缚和其他次要材料带给我，我就为你制作一双强力的靴子。",
    ["You seek to prove your worth to my kind, mortal? Very well, perhaps we can be of mutual assistance. The ancient sandworm, Ouro, is a being of legendary power."] = "你想向我族证明你的价值吗，凡人？很好，也许我们可以互相帮助。远古沙虫奥罗是一位拥有传奇力量的存在。",
    ["The unmentionable Old God slowly awakens from his slumber beneath Ahn'Qiraj. The terrible fate that awaits Azeroth could come in days or years; time has no meaning for beings of his power."] = "那位不可名状的上古之神正从安其拉下的沉睡中慢慢苏醒。等待艾泽拉斯的可怕命运可能在几天或几年内降临；对拥有他那种力量的存在来说，时间毫无意义。",
    ["The Qiraji and their servants wield items made with the rarest and finest materials: bones from gargantuan ancient creatures, gems from the depths of the earth, metals pure and strong."] = "其拉和他们的仆从所用的物品由最稀有、最精良的材料制成：来自巨大古老生物的骨头，来自地底深处的宝石，纯净而坚固的金属。",
    ["The rings worn by the Qiraji lieutenants are rumored to grant them formidable abilities. The corrupted gems that adorn them could, in theory, be swapped out with more pure materials to create uncorrupted versions of the rings."] = "据说其拉副官们佩戴的戒指赋予他们强大的能力。装饰这些戒指的腐化宝石，理论上可以换成更纯净的材料，制作出未被腐化的戒指。",
    ["I'm glad to hear you're aiding us in our attack on Ahn'Qiraj. I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy."] = "很高兴听说你在协助我们进攻安其拉。我可以给你做一件防护用品，对对抗我们的敌人会有帮助。",
    ["A terrible menace has been laid to rest. The cruel Ossirian has been vanquished. The denizens of Kalimdor would be relieved to know of this victory."] = "一个可怕的威胁已被平息。残酷的奥斯里安已被击败。卡利姆多的居民得知这场胜利一定会松一口气。",
    ["I should have known. My arch-enemy, Doctor Weavil, up to his old tricks! And now, thanks to your failure in Winterspring, Doctor Weavil has destroyed my book!"] = "我早该想到的。我的死敌，威比尔博士，又在耍老花招！而现在，多亏你在冬泉谷的失败，威比尔博士毁掉了我的书！",
    ["Did I mention the bad news yet? Its name is Maws: 100 feet of death and destruction. I guess I may have forgotten that little tidbit."] = "我提过坏消息了吗？它的名字叫巨口：100英尺长的死亡与毁灭。我想我可能忘了说这个小细节。",
    ["Champion, is it you? A thousand years it has been since I was entrusted the shard and it is at my darkest hour that one should rise to relieve me of it..."] = "勇士，是你吗？自从我被托付这块碎片以来已经过去了一千年，而偏偏在我最黑暗的时刻，会有人站出来为我卸下它……",
    ["We must use restraint against Eranikus. We are to redeem him not destroy him. Tyrande is already en route to assist us in this task. We must weather the dragon's blows and save Nighthaven from certain destruction."] = "我们必须对埃拉尼库斯手下留情。我们要救赎他，而不是毁灭他。泰兰德已经在赶来协助我们完成这项任务的路上。我们必须承受巨龙的攻击，拯救夜之港免于必然的毁灭。",
    ["Twin emperor of the qiraji, and the one who inherited C'Thun's gift for magic instead of his brother's strength. Neither twin can be killed far from the other."] = "其拉的双子皇帝之一，继承了克苏恩的魔法天赋，而非他兄弟的力量。两个双子中任何一个都不能在远离另一个的地方被杀死。",
    ["Twin emperor of the qiraji, and the stronger arm of the pair. Kill one and the other heals him, so both must fall together."] = "其拉的双子皇帝之一，也是这对兄弟中更强壮的一方。杀死一个，另一个会为他治疗，所以两个必须同时倒下。",
    ["A sandworm grown enormous under the desert, surfacing only to feed."] = "一条在沙漠下长到巨大的沙虫，只有觅食时才会浮出地面。",
    ["A qiraji brood matron whose poison is potent enough that the fight is really a race against her venom."] = "一名其拉育母，毒性强到这场战斗其实就是一场与她毒液的赛跑。",
    ["A vast qiraji burrower that spawns its young mid-fight and hurls intruders into the walls."] = "一只巨大的其拉掘地者，战斗中途会孵化幼虫，并把入侵者掷向墙壁。",
    ["The qiraji empire's finest soldier, who fights with her honour guard and refuses to be separated from them."] = "其拉帝国最优秀的战士，与她的荣誉卫队并肩作战，拒绝与他们分开。",
    ["A living mass of qiraji poison. It has to be frozen solid and then shattered, which is not how most things die."] = "一团活着的其拉毒液。它必须被冻结成坚冰然后粉碎，这可不是大多数东西的死法。",
    ["One of the three qiraji councillors who fight as one -- kill any of them and the survivors grow stronger."] = "三位像一个人那样战斗的其拉议员之一——杀死其中任何一个，幸存者就会变得更强。",
    ["The third of the qiraji council, who charges the moment the fight begins and does not stop."] = "其拉议会的第三位，战斗一开始就冲锋，而且不会停下。",
    ["C'Thun's mouthpiece. Everything the qiraji believe, they believe because he told them the Old God said it."] = "克苏恩的传声筒。其拉所相信的一切，都是因为他告诉他们那是上古之神说的。",
    ["To the Caverns of Time you go, Lord:Lady;. Anachronos awaits your return. Give him the eye of C'Thun as he will undoubtedly wish to place it in his master's collection."] = "前往时光之穴吧，领主/女士。阿纳克洛斯在等你归来。把克苏恩之眼交给他，因为他无疑会想把它放进他主人的收藏中。",
    ["I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin. Bring me the belt and set of gloves that you wish to upgrade."] = "我想，如果要让你继续有兴趣拯救我这条命，就该给你一份奖赏。把你想要升级的腰带和手套带给我。",
    ["Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us. The only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the medallion back together."] = "瓦尔萨拉克的灵魂被保存在这条护符里。出于贪婪，我们愚蠢地把它分成了三部分，却不知等待我们的是什么诅咒。阻止瓦尔萨拉克法术的唯一办法就是把这枚勋章重新拼合起来。",
    ["I have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality. I'd be willing to trade the bracers for ordinary ones in exchange for a small favor."] = "我拥有一套很像你们这个职业的人所穿的护甲，但品质要高得多。我愿意用这副护腕换你一副普通的，条件是你帮我一个小忙。",
    ["That's an amazing story! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved. Now maybe I'll be able to sleep at night with both eyes shut."] = "真是个精彩的故事！谢谢你，也代表所有相关人员向你致以衷心的感谢。现在也许我晚上睡觉时能闭上两只眼睛了。",
    ["Yet I'm not one to give out favors freely, even if you were sent here by an old friend. I hold nothing but hatred and contempt for our brutish ogre neighbors."] = "但我可不是随便施恩的人，即使你是一位老朋友派来的。我对我们粗野的食人魔邻居只有仇恨和蔑视。",
    ["My brother and I run the poison operations out of the manor Ravenholdt."] = "我和我弟弟从乌鸦岭庄园经营毒药生意。",
    ["From the corpses of the fallen, the armor is stripped and taken back to Naxxramas to be used for unknown purposes."] = "阵亡者的尸体上，护甲被剥下并带回纳克萨玛斯，用于不明用途。",
    ["The Guardian's staff, broken and scattered. Rebuilding it means gathering forty splinters from Naxxramas, the base from Kel'Thuzad, and carrying it to the ruin of Karazhan where Medivh once held it."] = "守护者的法杖，破碎并散落各处。重建它意味着要从纳克萨玛斯收集四十块碎片，从克尔苏加德那里取得底座，并把它带到卡拉赞废墟，那是麦迪文曾经保管它的地方。",
    ["Thanks to you and Omarion, may he rest in peace, I am now able to create Glacial wrists."] = "多亏了你和欧玛里恩，愿他安息，我现在能制作冰川护腕了。",
    ["Greetings, friend. Have you insignias of the Dawn or the Crusade that you would like to redeem for items of great power?"] = "你好，朋友。你有想用来兑换强大物品的黎明或十字军徽记吗？",
    ["Thanks to you and Omarion, may he rest in peace, I am now able to create a Glacial cloak."] = "多亏了你和欧玛里恩，愿他安息，我现在能制作冰川披风了。",
    ["Thanks to you and Omarion, may he rest in peace, I am now able to create a Polar tunic."] = "多亏了你和欧玛里恩，愿他安息，我现在能制作极地外套了。",
    ["Thanks to you and Omarion (May he rest in peace), I am now able to create Polar gloves."] = "多亏了你和欧玛里恩（愿他安息），我现在能制作极地手套了。",
    ["Thanks to you and Omarion (May he rest in peace), I am now able to create Polar bracers."] = "多亏了你和欧玛里恩（愿他安息），我现在能制作极地护腕了。",
    ["Greetings, friend. Have you insignias of the Dawn or the Crusade that you would like to redeem for items of great power? I must warn you; purchases made at a friendly reputation with the Dawn come with an extremely hefty surcharge."] = "你好，朋友。你有想用来兑换强大物品的黎明或十字军徽记吗？我必须警告你：在与黎明的声望为友善时进行的购买会附加极其高昂的附加费。",
    ["Greetings, friend. Have you insignias of the Dawn or the Crusade that you would like to redeem for items of power? I must warn you; purchases made at a friendly reputation with the Dawn come with a hefty surcharge."] = "你好，朋友。你有想用来兑换强力物品的黎明或十字军徽记吗？我必须警告你：在与黎明的声望为友善时进行的购买会附加高昂的附加费。",
    ["You fancy yourself a hero of the Dawn, eh? I've seen our greatest soldiers get rolled over by Kel'Thuzad's plebes! How well could someone so clueless possibly fare in Naxxramas?"] = "你自认为是黎明的英雄，是吧？我见过我们最伟大的战士被克尔苏加德的杂兵碾压！像你这样一无所知的人，在纳克萨玛斯能有多大作为？",
    ["A crypt lord of Azjol-Nerub who took Arthas's side. He holds the Arachnid Quarter's outermost hall."] = "一名站在阿尔萨斯一边的艾卓·尼鲁布墓穴领主。他把守着蛛魔区最外层的大厅。",
    ["A worshipper of Kel'Thuzad who brought her followers with her into undeath, and still commands them."] = "克尔苏加德的崇拜者，她带着她的追随者一同进入亡灵状态，至今仍指挥着他们。",
    ["A giant spider webbed into the depths of the Arachnid Quarter, fed on whatever the Scourge no longer needs."] = "一只被蛛网困在蛛魔区深处的巨型蜘蛛，以天灾军团不再需要的东西为食。",
    ["An abomination stitched together from the Scourge's leftovers, built for nothing but raw strength."] = "一头由天灾军团的剩余物缝合而成的憎恶，造出来除了蛮力别无他用。",
    ["A stitched hound kept half-starved on purpose, so it would eat anything the Construct Quarter sent its way."] = "一头缝合而成的猎犬，被故意养得半饥半饱，好让它吃掉构造区送来的任何东西。",
    ["A death knight who trains the Scourge's new officers. He is too strong for his own students to touch, which is exactly the point of the lesson."] = "一名训练天灾军团新军官的死亡骑士。他强大到连他自己的学生也碰不到他，而这正是这堂课的要点。",
    ["Razuvious's colleague in the Military Quarter, who fights from behind his own dead and keeps sending them forward."] = "拉苏维奥斯在军事区的同僚，他躲在自己的亡者身后战斗，并不断把他们送上前线。",
    ["A necromancer of the Plague Quarter, promoted for his skill at raising what he had just finished killing."] = "瘟疫区的一名死灵法师，因擅长复活自己刚杀死的东西而获得晋升。",
    ["Keeper of Naxxramas's plague works, and of the corridor of eruptions that has killed more raiders than he has."] = "纳克萨玛斯瘟疫工坊的看守者，以及那条比他杀的人还多的喷发走廊的看守者。",
    ["A fungal horror grown in the Plague Quarter's spore vats -- less a creature than a crop that got out of hand."] = "一个在瘟疫区孢子桶里长出来的真菌恐怖——与其说是生物，不如说是一茬失控的庄稼。",
    ["A blue dragon slain in Northrend and raised as a frost wyrm. He guards the final approach to Kel'Thuzad's chamber."] = "一头在诺森德被杀死并被复活为霜火巨龙的蓝龙。他把守着通往克尔苏加德房间的最后通道。",
    ["Once an archmage of the Kirin Tor, he left Dalaran to found the Cult of the Damned and served Ner'zhul willingly. Killed at Andorhal and raised as a lich, he rules Naxxramas from a phylactery at its heart."] = "他曾是肯瑞托的大法师，离开达拉然创立了诅咒教派，并心甘情愿地侍奉耐萨里奥。在安多哈尔被杀并复活为巫妖后，他从位于纳克萨玛斯核心的灵魂容器中统治着这里。",
    ["Here's your cask of Evershine. And again, thank you for the hunting earlier."] = "这是你的永辉酒桶。再次感谢你之前的狩猎。",
    ["Recently, a new group of thieves has been hanging around Northshire. They call themselves the Defias Brotherhood, and have been seen across the river to the east."] = "最近，一伙新的盗贼一直在北郡一带游荡。他们自称迪菲亚兄弟会，有人看到他们在东边河对岸出没。",
    ["The Rites of the Earthmother are the steps a young tauren needs to take to gain respect in Thunder Bluff. First you must pass the Rite of Strength."] = "大地之母的仪式是年轻牛头人在雷霆崖赢得尊重所必须迈出的步骤。首先你必须通过力量仪式。",
    ["My brother Senir and I were sent to different parts of Dun Morogh to investigate the threat posed by the trolls. The Senate has its hands full with the troggs, so they've no need for further annoyances."] = "我哥哥塞尼尔和我被派往丹莫罗的不同地方，调查巨魔构成的威胁。议会已经被穴居人搞得焦头烂额，不需要更多的烦恼。",
    ["Scarlet Crusaders have been raiding from the ruined tower in northern Tirisfal, past Faol's Rest. According to the information we have, a ruthless commander named Captain Melrache is in charge of this evil crew."] = "血色十字军一直在法奥休憩地以外、提瑞斯法北部的废弃塔楼里发动袭击。根据我们掌握的情报，一名名叫梅尔拉什上尉的无情指挥官负责这伙邪恶的人马。",
    ["Your cleansing of the Winterhoof and Thunderhorn wells is spoken among the spirits, young. The Wildmane Totem is made, and your last task lies ahead."] = "你净化冬蹄和雷角水井的事在灵魂之间传颂，年轻人。野鬃图腾已经制成，你最后的任务就在前方。",
    ["Gazlowe told me once, \"Rezlak. There's one thing you need to know in life, and that's if you want something done well, do it yourself.\" I can't deal with losing all our caravans, so I'm just going to take matters into my own hands."] = "加兹鲁维曾经对我说：“雷兹拉克。人生中你需要知道一件事，那就是如果你想把事情做好，就自己动手。”我无法忍受失去我们所有的商队，所以我要自己动手了。",
    ["My journal! They took it away to the cave. The one that had it... It was a big brute with some odd markings on his skin and face. I didn't get a much better look than that."] = "我的日志！他们把它带到洞穴里去了。拿着它的那个……是个大块头的野兽，皮肤和脸上有些奇怪的印记。我没看清楚更多了。",
    ["Without the blessings of Alexstrasza the Life-Binder and Nozdormu the Timeless, Teldrassil's growth has not been without flaw."] = "没有生命缚结者阿莱克丝塔萨和永恒者诺兹多姆的祝福，泰达希尔的成长并非没有缺陷。",
    ["You'll be happy to know we appear to be making progress in the mine, thanks in no small part to your efforts. We can now turn our eyes to other concerns."] = "你会很高兴地知道，我们在矿洞里似乎取得了进展，这在很大程度上要归功于你的努力。现在我们可以把目光转向其他事务了。",
    ["Two extra attacks on a proc, on a fast axe. Warriors farmed Dire Maul for this one item and nothing else."] = "一把快斧，触发时额外两次攻击。战士们为了这一件物品反复刷厄运之槌，别无他求。",
    ["We were deep in a vast mine in Westfall, hidden beneath a barn in Moonbrook. No clue where these stinkin' thieving types came from. Anyway, the mine tunnel collapsed on us."] = "我们当时在西部荒野一座巨大的矿洞深处，藏在月溪的一座谷仓下面。不知道这些臭烘烘的盗贼是从哪儿冒出来的。总之，矿洞坑道在我们头上塌了。",
    ["Here, take this and lay it on his grave. Maybe... somehow, he'll know that I'm okay, and that none of us hold him responsible for what happened."] = "来，拿着这个放在他的坟上。也许……不知怎么的，他会知道我没事，我们谁也不认为这件事要怪他。",
    ["Stalvan Mistmantle led a life of depravity. Innocent victims died by his hand. Undoubtedly he is guilty of countless crimes. Now the lunatic threatens Darkshire."] = "斯塔尔文·雾衣过着堕落的生活。无辜的受害者死在他手上。毫无疑问，他犯下了无数罪行。现在这个疯子威胁着暮色森林。",
    ["I do not know why, but a festering grows within the Wetlands. Fen Creepers have risen. They are diseased, fevered blisters on the land, and for the fever to break they must be dispatched and allowed to settle back into the marshes."] = "我不知道为什么，湿地里正在滋生腐烂。沼泽爬行者出现了。它们是大地上带病的、发热的水疱，要让热度退去，它们必须被消灭，让它们重新沉回沼泽。",
    ["Think you can match wits with Daryl the Bold, huh? I should think not! Of course, you're more than welcome to try. Here's a challenge that should prove to be above your abilities, so don't feel too bad if you can't face up to it."] = "你以为你能和大胆的达里尔斗智，是吧？我看不行！当然，欢迎你尝试。这里有个超出你能力的挑战，所以如果面对不了，也别太难过。",
    ["Recently, just before the Troggs surfaced within the site, we had uncovered a large number of strange, carved idols. But we didn't have the chance to study them, for soon after their discovery the Troggs chased us away from the ruins!"] = "最近，就在穴居人出现在遗址里之前，我们发现了大量奇怪的雕刻神像。但我们没来得及研究，因为它们被发现后不久，穴居人就把我们从废墟里赶了出来！",
    ["Now that the catapults have been burned, find and kill Chieftain Nek'rosh."] = "既然投石车已经被烧毁，去找到并杀死酋长奈克罗什。",
    ["Murlocs are becoming a problem. Larger groups of the fishmen are dropping anchor along the shores of Lake Everstill and fishing up a storm!"] = "鱼人正在成为问题。更大的鱼人群体正沿着静水湖岸边抛锚，大肆捕鱼！",
    ["ath, is it? I can tell you're bursting with pride over completing the first test, hm? As I told you before, it's no large feat. You should try your hand at boar hunting."] = "阿斯，是吗？我看得出你因完成第一个试炼而得意洋洋，嗯？我之前说过，这不算什么大本事。你该试试猎野猪。",
    ["Me and some other warriors were sent by the Warchief to retrieve an object from Durnholde and to investigate this so-called Syndicate."] = "我和其他几名战士被酋长派去从敦霍尔德取回一件东西，并调查这个所谓的辛迪加。",
    ["The pendant? Of course you can have it... Take it! I want no memory of him... just please, please leave in peace..."] = "吊坠？当然可以给你……拿去吧！我不想留下关于他的任何记忆……只求你，只求你平静地离开……",
    ["To survive, I have to be tricky! I know the recipe for flash bombs."] = "为了生存，我必须狡猾！我知道闪光炸弹的配方。",
    ["He's done it this time! Bad enough that Gelriz's muscling out the moguls who were appointed by the trade princes, now he tries to cut in on the most notorious pirate!"] = "这次他可做过头了！吉尔里兹排挤商业亲王任命的大亨还不够，现在他又想插手那个最臭名昭著的海盗的生意！",
    ["You have proven yourself time and again, and your resourcefulness seems to rival even that of Kurzen himself. You may be the salvation of our band of rebels...if you can pit yourself against Kurzen and prevail!"] = "你一次又一次地证明了自己，你的机智似乎连库尔森本人都比不上。如果你能与库尔森对决并获胜，你也许就是我们这伙叛军的救星！",
    ["The Stromgarde Militia has placed bounties on the heads of Lord Falconcrest, and his bodyguard Otto. Falconcrest heads the Syndicate's efforts in the Arathi Highlands, and his death would cause a major disruption in those efforts."] = "斯通纳德民兵已为鹰冠勋爵和他的保镖奥托的人头悬赏。鹰冠是辛迪加在阿拉希高地行动的负责人，他的死将使这些行动遭受重大破坏。",
    ["You serve my husband well, but he does not know why Hammerfall is under attack."] = "你为我丈夫效力得很好，但他不知道为什么落锤镇会遭到攻击。",
    ["Ambassador Infernus was sent to Angor Fortress by Ragnaros himself to mind the Shadowforge seeking lost artifacts in Uldaman. It has already meant tremendous casualties for our people, but it has obviously grown worse."] = "因菲努斯大使由拉格纳罗斯亲自派往安格尔要塞，监督影踪矮人在奥达曼搜寻失落的神器。这已经给我们的族人造成了巨大的伤亡，而且情况显然变得更糟了。",
    ["Prospector Whelgar now holds the original fossil at his site in the Wetlands. When I discovered the Stone of Relu, I believed it to be the key to unlocking the mystery of the fossil."] = "勘探者维尔加现在把那块原始化石保管在他位于湿地的据点里。当我发现雷鲁之石时，我以为它就是解开化石之谜的钥匙。",
    ["When I struggled with the Forsaken's poisons, I had a vision. I had a vision of the druids in the Dor'danil Barrow Den, poisoned... murdered by the undead!"] = "当我与被遗忘者的毒药苦苦抗争时，我看到了一个幻象。我看到多丹尼尔巢穴里的德鲁伊们被毒害……被亡灵谋杀了！",
    ["We shall rein in the worgen problem, have no worry of that. This evil that your friend introduced to our woods will be contained, and I bear her no ill will for her actions."] = "我们会遏制住狼人问题，不必担心。你的朋友带到我们森林里的这股邪恶会被控制住，我对她的所作所为并无恶意。",
    ["It makes them go berserk! Bring me 8 idols - I want to study them, and I want them out of Trogg hands!"] = "它会让它们变得狂暴！给我带8个神像来——我想研究它们，也想让它们远离穴居人之手！",
    ["Head back to Belgrom in Orgrimmar and tell him Moktar be doing his bidding well out in the Thousand Needles. Tell him also, that me studies progress, and I hope to be havin' learned more soon."] = "回奥格瑞玛找贝尔格罗姆，告诉他莫克塔在千针石林把他交代的事办得很好。还要告诉他，我的研究在进展，我希望很快能了解更多。",
    ["It took a long time, but I found Reethe. He hide good for a human. Ogron worried that he might be crazy after so much time in swamp. You come with me for we go get answers from him."] = "花了很长时间，但我找到里斯了。他躲得很好，对人类来说。奥格隆担心他在沼泽里待了这么久可能疯了。你跟我来，我们去从他那里问出答案。",
    ["I am so lost! My wife, Torta, sent me out to fetch dinner and I must have taken a wrong turn somewhere. Would you be so kind as to lead me back to Torta?"] = "我迷路了！我妻子托尔塔让我出来找晚饭，我一定是在哪里拐错了弯。你能行行好带我回到托尔塔身边吗？",
    ["The venom you gathered from the Witherbark's spider god is quite a find! I've been able to kill nearly two dozen rabbits with just a drop of the stuff."] = "你从枯木部落的蜘蛛神那里收集到的毒液真是个了不起的发现！我只用一滴这东西，就毒死了将近两打兔子。",
    ["If you would be so kind as to deliver the relic to my wife Vestia, I would appreciate it. She's not only a fine priestess for our community, but she is one of the most well-versed scholars you'll find anywhere."] = "如果你能行行好把这件圣物交给我的妻子薇丝蒂亚，我会很感激。她不仅是我们社群里出色的女祭司，也是你能找到的最博学的学者之一。",
    ["Edana Hatetalon is the queen of the Northspring harpies that reside in the ruins to the west. She is pure evil; I have heard that her heart is one of crystal."] = "埃达娜·憎爪是住在西边废墟里的北泉鹰身人的女王。她是纯粹的邪恶；我听说她的心是水晶做的。",
    ["You dare challenge Overlord Mok'Morokk? Haw! Me crush tiny! You tell me when ready for good beating."] = "你竟敢挑战大领主莫克莫洛克？哈！我捏碎小东西！你准备好挨揍了就告诉我。",
    ["Listen well. While the four towers can never be destroyed, you can use the torch of retribution to set them ablaze for a very long period of time: A fire that no element or force can subdue."] = "听好了。虽然这四座塔永远无法被摧毁，但你可以用复仇火炬让它们燃烧很长一段时间：一团任何元素或力量都无法扑灭的火焰。",
    ["Just one last thing you must do, soldier. I've taken the liberty of putting Gor'tesh's head on a pike. Now all you have to do is take this head to the top of Dreadmaul Rock and stick it into the ground."] = "士兵，你还有最后一件事要做。我自作主张把格尔泰什的头插在了长矛上。现在你只需要把这颗头带到恐怖之槌岩的顶上，插进土里。",
    ["While you have been exploring Un'Goro, I have seen other things that a mighty hunter such as yourself would relish in. One such sight was a huge ape among the other gorillas to the north."] = "在你探索安戈洛的时候，我还看到了其他像你这样的强大猎手会喜欢的东西。其中之一就是北边其他大猩猩当中的一头巨大猿猴。",
    ["Wanted: A skilled fighter to deal with the threat of the Pterrordax that inhabit the Un'Goro Crater. Their numbers are growing, and they are becoming a menace to travelers in the area."] = "通缉：一名熟练的战士，对付栖息在安戈洛环形山的翼手龙的威胁。它们的数量在增长，正成为该地区旅行者的祸患。",
    ["I'm going to need more samples. But--and I don't know how to put this--they have to be pure samples. I know, I know. \"What does 'pure' mean, Laris?\" I'm not sure."] = "我还需要更多样本。但是——我不知道该怎么说——它们必须是纯净的样本。我知道，我知道。“‘纯净’是什么意思，拉里斯？”我也不确定。",
    ["The blade the Silver Hand carried against the Scourge, and the one Tirion Fordring's order was built around. Corrupted when Renault Mograine used it on his own father, Alexandros, in the Scarlet Monastery."] = "白银之手用来对抗天灾军团的利刃，也是提里奥·弗丁的骑士团赖以建立的那一把。当雷纳德·莫格莱尼在血色修道院用它对付自己的父亲阿历克山德罗斯时，它被腐化了。",
    ["You look like a capable. Perhaps you're looking to make some money? Cork and I started this caravan to make a bundle of money; little did we know the dangers of turning a buck!"] = "你看起来很能干。也许你想赚点钱？科克和我创办这支商队就是为了大赚一笔；可我们万万没想到赚钱要冒这么多危险！",
    ["Bibbly thinks he is the only goblin in Desolace who knows how to make money. Well, the only caravan brave enough to travel these parts relies on me."] = "比布利以为他是凄凉之地唯一懂得赚钱的地精。哼，唯一敢在这一带旅行的商队可是靠我的。",
    ["While I do possess much knowledge about the owlbeasts you defeated in Winterspring, I am not very learned on the subject of the magics they wield."] = "虽然我对你在冬泉谷击败的枭兽确实了解很多，但对它们所掌握的魔法却不太精通。",
    ["Mirah Chandler's song, given for finishing a chain of favours in the Barrens -- the reward players remember long after they forget the errands."] = "米拉·钱德勒的歌，完成贫瘠之地一系列人情任务后获得的奖励——玩家在忘记那些跑腿任务很久之后，依然记得它。",
    ["Kill me. Before it's too late. I am Hameya. While traveling to Zul'Mashar, my brethren and I ate some bad meat... and we changed. We are infected."] = "杀了我。趁还来得及。我是哈梅亚。在前往祖玛沙尔的路上，我和兄弟们吃了坏掉的肉……然后我们变了。我们被感染了。",
    ["The black dragonflight's overseer in Lower Blackrock Spire, keeping the orcs there in line on Nefarian's behalf."] = "黑龙军团在黑石塔下层的监工，替奈法利安管束那里的兽人。",
    ["Demetria is chief advisor to the Grand Crusader. She is called the Oracle due to her 'otherworldly' senses. She has successfully assisted the Crusade in several of their victories against the Scourge."] = "迪米特利亚是大十字军的首席顾问。因为她“超凡脱俗”的感知，人们称她为神谕者。她曾成功协助十字军赢得数场对抗天灾军团的胜利。",
    ["you are a hunter worthy of our company. From the battlefields of Lordaeron to the deepest jungle, I have rarely witnessed such prowess with weaponry as you have demonstrated."] = "你是一名值得与我们为伍的猎人。从洛丹伦的战场到最深的丛林，我很少见过有人像你一样展现出如此精湛的武器技艺。",
    ["One of Onyxia's own teeth, taken after she was finally dragged out of Stormwind's court and killed in her lair."] = "奥妮克希亚自己的牙齿之一，是在她最终被拖出暴风城王廷并在巢穴中被杀死之后取得的。",
    ["A lieutenant of Ragnaros who fights surrounded by his Firesworn, and grows stronger each time one of them falls."] = "拉格纳罗斯的一名副官，在火誓者的环绕下作战，每当其中一个倒下，他就会变得更强。",
    ["I'm going to have to do something about the giants if I stay out here! They're certainly not good for business, now are they?"] = "如果我留在这里，就得对那些巨人想点办法了！它们当然对生意没好处，不是吗？",
    ["Wouldn't ye know it, every time ol' Hansel wants to take a moment to relax and reflect upon his life, the powers that be give him another job."] = "你瞧，每次老汉瑟尔想歇口气，回顾一下自己的人生，当权者就会再给他派一份活。",
    ["One of Nefarian's three guardian drakes, holding the suspended walkways above the lair floor."] = "奈法利安三头守卫龙之一，把守着巢穴地面上方悬空的步道。",
    ["We Zandalar prize what we wear as a symbol of accomplishment."] = "我们赞达拉人把所穿戴的东西视为成就的象征。",
    ["You must master both to have any chance of success in Zul'Gurub... and any chance of being like the Zandalar predators."] = "想要在祖尔格拉布获得成功，你必须掌握两者……也才有机会成为像赞达拉掠食者那样的人。",
    ["In the dark times after the fall of the Gurubashi Empire, Zandalar predators used their prowess to provide sustenance for the tribe."] = "在古拉巴什帝国陨落后的黑暗时代，赞达拉的掠食者用他们的本领为部族提供食物。",
    ["To Whom It May Concern: If you're reading this, I'm either dead or soon to be dead. It's hard to say. Most of the crew is dead anyhow. Found information about a Titan."] = "致相关人士：如果你在读这封信，那我要么已经死了，要么快死了。很难说。反正大部分船员都死了。发现了一些关于泰坦的信息。",
    ["We have not sat idly by for a millennium. We have watched these beasts feast on their own when they have exhausted their utility. We have listened as they have plotted and schemed to destroy our world."] = "我们并没有袖手旁观千年。我们看着这些野兽在耗尽价值后互相吞食。我们听着它们密谋策划，要摧毁我们的世界。",
    ["Qiraji magic is strong and ancient. The most powerful qiraji wield items of such might, they'd give pause even to a dragon."] = "其拉的魔法强大而古老。最强大的其拉所用的物品拥有如此威力，连巨龙也会为之迟疑。",
    ["Bring me the bindings worn by the highest Qiraji leaders and I shall shape them into a set of pauldrons more dreadful than even the wings of Nefarian himself!"] = "把其拉最高首领所佩戴的束缚带给我，我会把它们制成一副比奈法利安本人的双翼还要可怕的肩甲！",
    ["Bring me a sample of his skin along with other minor components and I shall craft you leggings of great power."] = "把他的皮肤样本和其他次要材料带给我，我会为你打造一条拥有强大力量的护腿。",
    ["I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin. Bring me an ordinary belt and a set of gloves that you wish to upgrade."] = "我想，如果要让你继续有兴趣拯救我这条命，就该给你一份奖赏。把一条普通的腰带和一副你想要升级的手套带给我。",
    ["I have discovered a use for the carapace of the crypt fiend. I am able to fashion an extremely light and very deadly set of armor by combining the fragments with some of the desecrated magical armors lost in Naxxramas."] = "我发现了地穴恶魔甲壳的用途。把碎片与一些在纳克萨玛斯丢失的被亵渎的魔法护甲结合起来，我能制成一套极其轻便又极其致命的护甲。",
    ["Thanks to you and Omarion (May he rest in peace), I am now able to create an Icy Scale breastplate."] = "多亏了你和欧玛里恩（愿他安息），我现在能制作冰鳞胸甲了。",
    ["Thanks to you and Omarion, may he rest in peace, I am now able to create Icy Scale bracers."] = "多亏了你和欧玛里恩，愿他安息，我现在能制作冰鳞护腕了。",
    ["Stormwind has abandoned us. A foul wind of depravity rustles through the plains of Westfall. This was my homeland and I will not turn my back on the citizens who choose to remain here."] = "暴风城抛弃了我们。一阵堕落的恶风在西部荒野的平原上沙沙作响。这是我的故乡，我不会背弃选择留在这里的市民。",
    ["The Defias gang in Northshire wears burlap masks, but the Defias in Elwynn wear linen which I can use to make fine linen goods."] = "北郡的迪菲亚帮派戴麻布面具，但艾尔文的迪菲亚戴亚麻面具，我可以用它来制作上好的亚麻制品。",
    ["If the \"Collector\" is taking gold from our mines then he's stealing from the kingdom! Bring the Collector to justice, and bring me the ring mentioned in the pickup schedule you gave me."] = "如果“收藏者”正从我们的矿洞里拿走黄金，那他就是在偷窃王国的财产！把收藏者绳之以法，再把你交给我的收取时间表里提到的戒指带给我。",
    ["Help me make some Westfall Stew! Come back with the following ingredients: 3 Stringy Vulture Meat 3 Goretusk Snouts 3 Murloc Eyes 3 Okra"] = "帮我做些西部荒野炖肉！带着以下材料回来：3份坚韧的秃鹫肉、3个血牙猪鼻、3只鱼人眼睛、3个秋葵。",
    ["Gnolls, brutish creatures with no decent business in these lands, have been seen along the borders of Elwynn Forest. A large pack of them, many more than we can handle alone, have infested the woods south of the guard tower yonder."] = "有人在艾尔文森林边境看到了豺狼人，这些粗野的家伙在这片土地上没有正经事。一大群豺狼人，比我们自己能应付的多得多，已经占据了那边哨塔以南的树林。",
    ["I'm behind on my report, and could use your help. I just managed to find where the trolls are holed up, but I saw so many trolls, I was afraid to go in."] = "我的报告落后了，需要你的帮助。我刚找到巨魔的藏身之处，但我看到巨魔太多了，不敢进去。",
    ["You've shown your potential to the Forsaken under normal circumstances - now let's see you under pressure. The Rattlecage skeletons, more mindless minions of the Lich King, are a tougher foe than the zombies you have faced thus far."] = "你已经在正常情况下向被遗忘者展示了你的潜力——现在让我们看看你在压力下的表现。嘎嘎响的骷髅，是巫妖王更没脑子的爪牙，比你目前遇到的僵尸更难对付。",
    ["We Forsaken are at war with the Lich King's army of the Scourge: necromantically raised armies of the undead, foul beasts of the north, and tormented spectres."] = "我们被遗忘者正与巫妖王的天灾军团交战：用死灵法术复活的亡灵大军、北方的邪恶野兽，以及饱受折磨的幽魂。",
    ["Reports from my superiors in Brill indicate that an agent of the Scarlet Crusade was dispatched from the Scarlet Monastery and sent here to Deathknell."] = "我在布瑞尔的上级报告说，一名血色十字军的特工从血色修道院被派出，并被派到了这里的丧钟镇。",
    ["While you were out gathering, I uncovered some old text in one of my tomes that indicates that an ancient plague wiped out thousands of innocent victims."] = "你外出采集的时候，我在一本典籍里发现了一段古老的文字，说明一场远古瘟疫夺去了数千名无辜者的生命。",
    ["The Scourge are trying to form a base at the Agamand Mills. If they do, then they can stage further attacks within Tirisfal. The orders have been given."] = "天灾军团正试图在阿加曼德磨坊建立基地。如果他们成功，就可以从那里对提瑞斯法发动进一步的袭击。命令已下达。",
    ["The Stormwind Army has placed a bounty on murloc lurkers and foragers in Elwynn. Slaughter them and bring me their torn murloc fins, and the Stormwind Army will reward you well."] = "暴风城军队悬赏艾尔文的潜伏鱼人和采集鱼人。杀掉它们，把它们撕裂的鱼人鳍带给我，暴风城军队会重重奖赏你。",
    ["I was sent to the Valley to guide you, but I have discovered a growing taint here... A group that calls itself the Burning Blade has a coven here in the Valley of Trials."] = "我被派到山谷来为你引路，但我发现这里有一股日益增长的污染……一个自称燃刃军团的团体在试炼谷建立了巢穴。",
    ["The sabercat's fur is a distinctive gray color, blending into the surrounding forest. As she lays there, you observe that she is badly wounded, with deep lacerations across her back and stomach."] = "剑齿虎的皮毛是独特的灰色，与周围的森林融为一体。当她躺在那里时，你看出她伤得很重，背上和肚子上有深深的裂伤。",
    ["There is a malevolence growing in the timberlings. We are trying to find the source, but until we do...in order to keep Teldrassil safe we must cut down the timberlings who are beyond help."] = "小树人中正滋生着一种恶意。我们正试图找出源头，但在找到之前……为了保证泰达希尔的安全，我们必须砍倒那些已经无药可救的小树人。",
    ["I trust the Valley of Trials will teach you much, young. I was sent to the Valley to guide you, but I have discovered a growing taint here..."] = "我相信试炼谷会教给你很多东西，年轻人。我被派到山谷来为你引路，但我发现这里有一股日益增长的污染……",
    ["I had a month's worth of dried meats salted and locked away for the cold season. Kept it locked so the bears wouldn't get it! But while I was off hunting deer, that beast, Old Icebeard, made off with the meat locker."] = "我备好了一个月份的肉干，腌好并锁起来过冬。我锁着，就是不让熊吃到！可是我外出猎鹿的时候，那头野兽，老冰须，把整个肉柜都拖走了。",
    ["Teebu's blade sets things on fire for reasons no one has ever explained. It is famous for being almost useless and deeply desirable at the same time."] = "提布的剑会因为从未有人解释过的原因点燃东西。它既几乎毫无用处，又令人极度渴望，因此而出名。",
    ["By order of High Executor Darthalia, the human known as Baron Vardus is wanted for crimes against the Forsaken. Vardus is known to be a high-ranking member of the organization known as the Syndicate."] = "奉高阶执行者达尔萨莉亚之命，人类瓦达斯男爵因对被遗忘者犯下的罪行而遭到通缉。据悉瓦达斯是辛迪加组织的高阶成员。",
    ["Our initial scouting reports of Silverpine show the rot hides have a base at an old farm to the north, the Dead Fields."] = "我们对银松森林的最初侦察报告显示，腐皮兽人在北边的一座旧农场，枯萎之地，设有一处据点。",
    ["You looking fer work? I might have some if you're up for a little challenge. I got a friend named Groy who makes a killing selling what the naga call akiris reed: it's some kind of valuable ocean reed."] = "你在找活干吗？如果你愿意接受一点小挑战，我可能有。我有个朋友叫格罗伊，靠卖纳迦所说的阿奇里斯芦苇赚了不少钱：那是某种珍贵的海洋芦苇。",
    ["But the power harnessed in these goggles will allow you to locate them easily. A little gnomish ingenuity goes a long way!"] = "但这副护目镜所蕴含的力量能让你轻易找到它们。一点侏儒的巧思大有作为！",
    ["Now that you've had a taste of the Crushridge ogres, I want you to really bloody their noses... Go into the Ruins of Alterac and seek out the Crushridge Warmongers."] = "既然你已经尝过碎岭食人魔的滋味，我想让你真正地打他们的鼻子……前往奥特兰克废墟，找到碎岭好战者。",
    ["I have received reports that a group of undead are holing up to prepare for an attack against us. Armed with this information, we can turn the tables and attack them first, nipping their little plan in the bud."] = "我收到报告，一群亡灵正躲在某处准备对我们发动袭击。有了这份情报，我们可以扭转局面，抢先攻击他们，把他们的小计划扼杀在萌芽状态。",
    ["Travelers keep asking me about the Stonetalon Mountains. It seems to be a popular place for adventure--it doesn't matter if you're seeking wyvern, elementals, or you have business with the Venture Co."] = "旅行者们不停地问我关于石爪山脉的事。那似乎是个热门的冒险地——不管你是要找飞龙、元素生物，还是和风险投资公司有生意往来。",
    ["Indurium has an amazing resistance to heat! I'm sure it will work for Fizzle's pistons."] = "铟锭具有惊人的耐热性！我确信它能用在菲兹尔的活塞上。",
    ["You have done well. You have passed my test, and the tests before mine. Return to Dorn in Thousand Needles."] = "你做得很好。你通过了我的试炼，以及我之前的试炼。回到千针石林的多恩那里去。",
    ["Strength has left me. Your help is needed! Long ago this site was a great temple of Elune. But misfortune led to ruin when the corruption of an Old God seeped up from beneath the earth and tainted the sacred Moon Well."] = "我已力竭。需要你的帮助！很久以前，这里是艾露恩的一座伟大神殿。但不幸导致了毁灭，一位上古之神的腐化从地下渗出，玷污了神圣的月亮井。",
    ["We mages do more than just waggle our fingers and make pretty sparks! We control magic, the base fabric of our world! And that takes great care, and resolve."] = "我们法师做的可不只是挥挥手指、变出漂亮的火花！我们掌控魔法，我们世界的基础织物！这需要极大的谨慎和决心。",
    ["This world has been victim to massive mystic struggles, which tore magic currents from once stable channels. We struggle to determine the effects these changes have caused, and some of us fear the worst!"] = "这个世界曾是巨大神秘斗争的受害者，这些斗争把魔法洪流从曾经稳定的通道中撕扯出来。我们努力判断这些变化造成了什么影响，我们中有些人害怕最坏的情况！",
    ["I'll go make the wands now."] = "我现在就去做魔杖。",
    ["Gnomeregan has fallen under the control of those dastardly troggs! The situation is grave but perhaps you can help. Deep in the Deadmines is a functional goblin shredder."] = "诺莫瑞根已经落入那些卑鄙的穴居人的控制之下！情况严重，但也许你能帮上忙。在死亡矿井深处有一台能用的地精伐木机。",
    ["Naralex had a noble goal. Our great leader aspired to enter the Emerald Dream and help regrow these harsh lands back into the lush forest it once was."] = "纳拉雷克斯有一个崇高的目标。我们伟大的领袖渴望进入翡翠梦境，帮助这些荒芜的土地重新长回曾经的茂密森林。",
    ["The moment the artifact is removed from the Monolith, you feel the energy in the Stave of Equinex begin to fade."] = "就在神器被从巨石碑上取下的那一刻，你感到均衡之杖中的能量开始消退。",
    ["Oh, you know what? That reminds me. You wanna finish up a little job I took up while I was in Tanaris? It's easy... Krinkle Goodsteel in Gadgetzan was lookin' for some stuff found here in Searing Gorge and a few other places."] = "哦，你知道吗？这让我想起了一件事。你想不想完成我在塔纳利斯时接下的一项小活？很简单……加基森的克林克尔·古德斯蒂尔在找一些这里灼热峡谷和另外几个地方出产的东西。",
    ["Off the coast of Darkshore to our north are two wrecked ships - the Silver Dawning and the Mist Veil. Some time ago, both ships ran afoul of the blasted murlocs as they sailed across the vast sea into Auberdine."] = "在我们北边的黑海岸外有两艘失事的船——银色黎明号和迷雾面纱号。不久前，两艘船在穿越浩瀚海洋驶往奥伯丁时，都遭遇了该死的鱼人。",
    ["A human lord who traded his life for undeath and became a lich in Scholomance. Killing him takes a blade specifically made to sever the bargain."] = "一位以生命换取不死之身、在通灵学院成为巫妖的人类领主。要杀死他，需要一把专门为斩断这一交易而制作的刀刃。",
    ["Rackmore's log tells of how his ship was sailing for Feathermoon Stronghold when it was attacked by seafaring creatures."] = "拉克莫尔的日志讲述了他的船驶向羽月要塞时遭到海洋生物攻击的经过。",
    ["The Vilebranch fight with supernatural ferocity. This is due to the foul magical weavings of the Vile Priestess Hexx. Throughout Jintha'alor you will find dark vessels of tainted blood."] = "邪枝部族以超自然的凶猛作战。这是因为邪恶的女祭司赫克丝那肮脏的魔法编织。在整个金萨阿罗，你会发现盛着污染之血的黑色容器。",
    ["How can one truly hope to win against a foe that is not even really there? We Zandalar know the power of this, and as such illusionists hold a honored place within the tribe."] = "人如何才能真正指望战胜一个根本不在那里的敌人？我们赞达拉人深知其中的力量，因此幻术师在部族中占据着受人尊敬的位置。",
    ["For you to know the way of our illusionists, go to Zul'Gurub and bring back to me selected Paragons of Power. For this, I will give you arm wraps our illusionists use to weave their spells."] = "想要了解我们幻术师的方式，就前往祖尔格拉布，把挑选出的力量典范带给我。作为回报，我会给你我们的幻术师编织法术时所用的护腕。",
    ["Legend states that their ancient robes never looked the same twice. I will give you an illusionist's robe..."] = "传说他们古老的长袍从来没有两次看起来一样。我会给你一件幻术师的长袍……",
    ["There is a green drake deep in the sunken temple of Atal'Hakkar by the name of Morphaz. Years ago, he overwhelmed me in a bold ambush and consumed my apprentice whole."] = "在阿塔哈卡沉没的神庙深处，有一头名叫莫尔法兹的绿龙。几年前，他在一次大胆的伏击中制服了我，把我的学徒整个吞了下去。",
    ["I can make you a protective item that'll be of assistance in the fight against our enemy. I shall need a Qiraji drape, which I'll resize for you of course."] = "我可以给你做一件防护用品，对对抗我们的敌人会有帮助。我需要一条其拉披风，当然我会为你调整大小。",
    ["Well met. I've something that might interest you. I have in my possession a set of armor much like the one worn by those of your profession, but of much higher quality."] = "幸会。我有样东西也许你会感兴趣。我拥有一套很像你们这个职业的人所穿的护甲，但品质要高得多。",
    ["While the majority of the books were filled with - to put it bluntly - tripe, there were some gems. One of those tomes documented the creation of a set of armor fit for an archmage: Frostfire."] = "虽然大多数书里——说白了——都是废话，但也有一些宝贝。其中一本典籍记载了一套适合大法师的护甲的制作方法：霜火。",
    ["Now that my crop is saved, take this Grape Manifest to Brother Neals. He manages the store of food and drink in Northshire, and I'm sure he'll be delighted to hear that he has fresh grapes."] = "既然我的庄稼保住了，把这份葡萄清单带给尼尔斯兄弟吧。他管理着北郡的食物和饮料库存，我相信他听说有新鲜葡萄一定会很高兴。",
    ["My friend and fellow Siege Engine pilot, Mori Hildelve, is lost in the hills."] = "我的朋友兼攻城器械驾驶员同伴，莫里·希尔德尔夫，在山里迷路了。",
    ["After carefully evaluating the map, you realize that what you discovered are the plans made by the Bristleback warchief for an extended siege on Camp Narache."] = "仔细研究地图后，你意识到你发现的是刺背酋长对纳拉其营地进行长期围攻的计划。",
    ["My grandfather told me stories about his battles with a strider named Mazzranache. He told me of its demonic red eyes, razor-sharp talons and venomous bite."] = "我祖父给我讲过他和一头名叫马兹拉纳奇的陆行鸟战斗的故事。他告诉我它那恶魔般的红眼睛、剃刀般锋利的利爪和有毒的毒牙。",
    ["Take this Nether Gem to my old comrade Bethor. It will let us communicate... and I have much to tell him."] = "把这块虚空宝石带给我的老战友贝索尔。它能让我们互相交流……而我有很多话要对他说。",
    ["you are a with proven interest in the security of Northshire. You are now tasked with the protection of the surrounding Elwynn Forest."] = "你是一个对北郡安全怀有公认关切的人。你现在受命保护周围的艾尔文森林。",
    ["He has overpowered all attempts at his capture. The Stormwind Army has placed a generous bounty on the Gnoll."] = "他挫败了所有捉拿他的尝试。暴风城军队为这头豺狼人悬赏了一大笔赏金。",
    ["Many a hunter is attracted to Loch Modan to hunt our famous crocs. There are always merchants who seek out crocolisk skins for clothing items or armor, and there are also some who enjoy the taste of their meat."] = "许多猎人被吸引到洛克莫丹来猎捕我们著名的鳄鱼。总有商人在寻找鳄鱼皮用于衣物或护甲，也有些人喜欢它们的肉味。",
    ["Many of my soldiers died in the battle of Dun Modr. My own brother perished when the West Bridge over the Thandol Span was destroyed. Aye, the Dark Iron dwarves are a devilish breed."] = "我的许多士兵死在丹莫德之战中。我自己的兄弟在桑多尔跨度上的西桥被毁时丧生。是啊，黑铁矮人是一个恶魔般的种族。",
    ["Hail. Perhaps you've seen those spiders that have taken over the western border? The eight-legged menaces are too much for us to handle, and the Commander hasn't enough manpower to spare so far from Darkshire."] = "你好。也许你看到了占据西部边境的那些蜘蛛？这些八条腿的祸害我们应付不过来，而指挥官在离夜色镇这么远的地方也抽不出足够的人手。",
    ["My former mentor in the Stormwind city guard sent a message to me that Alliance High Command is becoming concerned with the threat posed by the naga."] = "我在暴风城城市卫队的前导师给我捎信说，联盟最高指挥部越来越担心纳迦构成的威胁。",
    ["But complications have arisen. A local band of ogres has occupied the Mizjah Ruins to the southeast of Grom'gol."] = "但出现了麻烦。当地的一伙食人魔占据了格罗姆高东南面的米兹加废墟。",
    ["I put my faith in you and anyone you can muster to help free me. The great Skymane King Mukla is my captor. He commands the beasts of this island, and they keep me here against my will with the aid of this chain."] = "我把希望寄托在你和你能召集的所有人身上，帮助我获得自由。伟大的天鬃之王穆克拉是囚禁我的人。他指挥着这座岛上的野兽，它们借助这条锁链违背我的意愿把我关在这里。",
    ["Curses! That swab Maury put a lock on his foot, and I can't open it! His loot's inside the foot, and that's what he owes me! We need to find the key to open the lock."] = "该死！那个蠢货莫里给他的脚上了锁，我打不开！他的战利品就在那只脚里，那是他欠我的！我们得找到打开锁的钥匙。",
    ["Blast the nerve of Firallon! He couldn't sail a skiff through Crystal Lake let alone lead an entire fleet against us. The Bloodsail Buccaneers will pay for their carelessness."] = "去他的菲拉隆的胆子！他连一艘小艇都开不过水晶湖，更别说率领整支舰队来对付我们了。血帆海盗会为他们的疏忽付出代价。",
    ["The light slowly fades, the sword Trol'kalar, held within a stone sheath has been released."] = "光芒渐渐消退，封在石鞘中的剑特罗尔卡拉已被释放。",
    ["O'Breen led the ships into the cove. We were certain this is where the treasure could be found. The Harbinger docked safely but as the Maiden's Folly and Spirit of Silverpine approached the tides began to lower."] = "奥布林把船队带进了海湾。我们确信宝藏就在这里。使者号安全靠岸，但当少女之愚号和银松之魂号靠近时，潮水开始下降。",
    ["The treasure has been on the sea floor so long that the gems have calcified into thick stone. But the power harnessed in these goggles will allow you to locate them easily."] = "宝藏在海底沉没太久，宝石都已钙化成厚厚的石头。但这副护目镜所蕴含的力量能让你轻易找到它们。",
    ["It's going to be tough going here if I can't manage to scrounge up some materials to construct some defenses and other necessities. I've noticed that the ogres in the area seem to be well equipped with scrap metal."] = "如果我找不到材料来建造一些防御工事和其他必需品，这里的日子会很难熬。我注意到这一带的食人魔似乎配备了大量废金属。",
    ["The Syndicate in Stromgarde do battle with our contingent of militia there."] = "斯通纳德的辛迪加正与我们在那里的民兵分队交战。",
    ["I guess I'd better think about getting out of here, also. It won't take long for word of what happened here to spread to the higher ups, and I'm sure they wouldn't take too kindly to meeting me again."] = "我想我也最好考虑离开这里了。这里发生的事传到高层不会花多久，我相信他们不会乐意再见到我。",
    ["The Bloodfuries have been subdued. But they will regroup soon enough if action is not taken. Far south of the Barrens lies a land known as Thousand Needles."] = "血怒部族已被压制。但如果不采取行动，他们很快就会重新集结。贫瘠之地的遥远南方有一片名叫千针石林的土地。",
    ["Delgren has asked me to deliver messages and supplies to Sentinel Starbreeze in Auberdine, but I am loathe to leave on my own."] = "德尔格伦请我给奥伯丁的哨兵星风送去消息和补给，但我不愿独自前往。",
    ["Although I have no knowledge of this Lord Azrethoc, I agree with Maurin, he must be stopped; especially if he is attempting to gain influence over the Burning Blade to further his goals."] = "虽然我对这位阿兹瑞托克勋爵一无所知，但我同意莫林的看法，必须阻止他；尤其是如果他想借此影响燃刃军团以达成他的目的。",
    ["Please help! These creatures are going to eat me! Help me out of here, and I'll give you a great treasure! It's in my camp in the swamp north of Stonard, but it's locked in a strongbox that can be opened through a trick that only I know."] = "请帮帮我！这些生物要吃了我！帮我离开这里，我会给你一件珍宝！它在斯通纳德以北沼泽里我的营地里，但锁在一只保险箱里，只有我知道的窍门才能打开。",
    ["Why don't we go over to the forge and get started on this? I've been preparing for your arrival for some time, so it shouldn't take long at all."] = "我们何不去铁匠铺开始做这件事呢？我已经为你的到来准备了一段时间，所以不会花很长时间。",
    ["Please, return to Duthorian and let him know that I'm safe for now. I have you and the Church to thank for that. He'll send word to Ironforge to let my Jordan know that he has nothing to fear."] = "请回到杜索里安那里，告诉他我暂时安全了。这要感谢你和教会。他会送信到铁炉堡，让我的乔丹知道他没什么好担心的。",
    ["Thanks again for your help. Here's a bottle of Steamwheedle bilge rum. Take it to MacKinley and he can finally put to rest his crazy beliefs about Booty Bay booze."] = "再次感谢你的帮助。这是一瓶热砂港舱底朗姆酒。把它带给麦金利，他终于可以放弃他关于藏宝海湾酒的疯狂想法了。",
    ["A plain plate glove that became famous for its random enchants -- the of Strength roll is a 7.9% chance and was worth chasing over guaranteed epics for years."] = "一只朴素的板甲手套，因随机附魔而出名——力量后缀的出现概率是7.9%，多年来比保底的史诗装备更值得追逐。",
    ["The gnome's voice crackles once again from the robot: \"I need to move OOX-09/HL to an open, safe place so it can begin a lengthy take-off procedure."] = "侏儒的声音再次从机器人里噼啪作响地传出：“我需要把OOX-09/HL移到一个开阔安全的地方，这样它才能开始漫长的起飞程序。",
    ["With the battle plans of the gnolls discovered, all that now remains is to bring the plans back to Hadoken Swiftstrider in Camp Mojache. Perhaps he or someone there can make further sense of what the gnolls are up to."] = "既然已经发现了豺狼人的作战计划，剩下的就是把计划带回莫沙彻营地的哈多肯·迅行者那里。也许他或那里的某个人能进一步弄清豺狼人在打什么主意。",
    ["Whilst that craven fool, Mok'Morokk, wallows in power and Tharg wrestles the demons of sorrow and vengeance and vies for leadership of the clan, I seem to be the only one concerned with identifying the source of aggression on our old home."] = "当那个懦弱的蠢货莫克莫洛克沉浸在权力里，塔尔格正与悲伤和复仇的恶魔搏斗并争夺氏族的领导权时，似乎只有我一个人在关心查明对我们旧家园发动攻击的根源。",
    ["What is left of a green dragon who went into the Sunken Temple after the Nightmare and did not come out himself."] = "一头进入沉没的神庙追击梦魇、却未能自己出来的绿龙所剩下的东西。",
    ["I'll tell you what. If you give me those unfired gauntlets, I will teach you how to make a set all your own."] = "我告诉你吧。如果你把那些未烧制的护手给我，我就教你如何制作一套完全属于你自己的。",
    ["For so long, I have been a puppet of the Grand Crusader. What reason was there to fight against what the Scarlet Crusade had become?"] = "这么久以来，我一直是大十字军的傀儡。为什么要对抗血色十字军变成的样子？",
    ["A core hound of the deep fire, kept as a guard beast and fed by Ragnaros's lieutenants."] = "一头深火之中的熔岩犬，被当作看守兽，由拉格纳罗斯的副官们喂养。",
    ["Everything was going well, but a large gust of wind blew through the camp and scattered the pages everywhere! I was able to gather most of the pages but many are still strewn about the jungle."] = "一切都很顺利，可是一阵大风吹过营地，把书页吹得到处都是！我收集了大部分书页，但仍有许多散落在丛林里。",
    ["Unfortunately, I can't dish out the beats like I used to, due to this here fat finger problem. Ye see, the climate out here combined with the lack o' air pressure makes me fingers expand."] = "不幸的是，由于这手指太粗的问题，我没法再像以前那样大打出手了。你看，这里的气候加上气压低，让我的手指膨胀。",
    ["Nefarian's best result: a two-headed chromatic horror carrying the breath of every dragonflight at once."] = "奈法利安的最佳成果：一头双头的彩色恐怖巨龙，同时携带着每个龙群的吐息。",
    ["They imbue their breastplates with powerful mojo. If their beliefs falter in the face of the enemy, their breastplate will not."] = "他们给胸甲灌注强大的魔力。如果他们的信念在敌人面前动摇，他们的胸甲却不会。",
    ["Your beliefs are alien to us, heathen. Ancient Zandalar were once branded as heretics."] = "你们的信仰对我们来说是陌生的，异教徒。古代赞达拉人曾被打上异端的烙印。",
    ["Heathens have a place in the tribe. Heathens are freethinkers of Zandalar."] = "异教徒在部族中有一席之地。异教徒是赞达拉的自由思想者。",
    ["One of Hakkar's high priests, who returns to his feet twice before he stays down."] = "哈卡的一位大祭司，会两次站起来才会倒下不动。",
    ["A green dragon of Ysera's flight, turned by the Nightmare and hunted across Feralas ever since."] = "伊瑟拉一族的一头绿龙，被梦魇扭曲，此后一直在菲拉斯被追猎。",
    ["The gems that adorn Qiraji idols would work quite well, as their quality is superior. Bring me the ring and idols and I'll create a powerful ring for you."] = "装饰其拉神像的宝石会很有用，因为它们的品质更优。把戒指和神像带给我，我会为你制作一枚强力戒指。",
    ["I believe a reward is in order if I'm to keep you interested in saving my skin. Bring me the belt and set of gauntlets that you wish to upgrade."] = "我想，如果要让你继续有兴趣拯救我这条命，就该给你一份奖赏。把你想要升级的腰带和护手带给我。",
    ["You will find the remnants of our fallen heroes on the corpses of the Lords of Naxxramas."] = "你会在纳克萨玛斯领主的尸体上找到我们阵亡英雄的遗物。",
    ["Thanks to you and Omarion (May he rest in peace), I am now able to create Icy Scale gauntlets."] = "多亏了你和欧玛里恩（愿他安息），我现在能制作冰鳞护手了。",
    ["Thanks to you and Omarion (May he rest in peace), I am now able to create an Icebane breastplate."] = "多亏了你和欧玛里恩（愿他安息），我现在能制作冰霜之殇胸甲了。",
    ["Thanks to you and Omarion, may he rest in peace, I am now able to create Icebane gauntlets."] = "多亏了你和欧玛里恩，愿他安息，我现在能制作冰霜之殇护手了。",
    ["Thanks to you and Omarion (May he rest in peace), I am now able to create Icebane bracers."] = "多亏了你和欧玛里恩（愿他安息），我现在能制作冰霜之殇护腕了。",
    ["This will at least protect her from harm longer if she finds trouble. Return to me here after you've done your duty to Elune."] = "如果她遇到麻烦，这至少能让她更久地免受伤害。你完成对艾露恩的职责后，回到这里来找我。",
    ["Normally I put forth a small challenge to followers of the Light to test their skill."] = "通常我会给光明的追随者出一个小小的挑战，来检验他们的技艺。",
    ["You be ready for your first test. South of Razor Hill, just outta town, one of our grunts be hurt fightin' off some o' Proudmoore's old troops."] = "准备好迎接你的第一个试炼吧。剃刀岭以南，刚出镇子，我们的一个兵在抵御普罗德摩尔旧部时受了伤。",
    ["Our power comes from darkness and shadow, but that is not your only role. You have acknowledged that there is merit in knowing the healing arts."] = "我们的力量来自黑暗与阴影，但那并不是你唯一的角色。你已经承认，了解治疗之术是有价值的。",
    ["But to blow the horn, you need a mouthpiece. To get a mouthpiece, kill Maraudine centaur."] = "但要吹响号角，你需要一个吹嘴。要得到吹嘴，就去杀玛拉顿的半人马。",
    ["You secure the sealed testing kit for the journey back to the Undercity. Apothecary Zinge waits for you and the sealed field testing kit there."] = "你把密封的测试工具包收好，准备返回幽暗城。药剂师辛格正在那里等着你和这个密封的野外测试工具包。",
    ["The confessors of the Zandalar all wear a distinctive mantle, marking them as the preservers of the tribe."] = "赞达拉的忏悔者都穿着独特的披肩，标志着他们是部族的守护者。",
    ["Shortly after the fall of the Gurubashi, we Zandalar almost succumbed to a final defeat from evil within our own tribe."] = "古拉巴什陨落后不久，我们赞达拉人几乎败给了来自我们自己部族内部的邪恶。",
    ["We Zandalar invest power in those who speak with the authority of divinity."] = "我们赞达拉人把力量赋予那些以神性的权威说话的人。",
    ["The poor souls whose last breaths were taken on the field of battle - stripped of everything including their dignity. Bring me the desecrated remnants of the departed along with reagents of purification and you shall know faith."] = "那些在战场上咽下最后一口气的可怜灵魂——被剥夺了一切，包括尊严。把逝者被亵渎的遗骸连同净化用的材料带给我，你就会知晓信仰。",
    ["I came to Shadowglen to observe the webwood spiders that dwell in the Shadowthread Cave."] = "我来到影踪谷，是为了观察栖息在影丝洞穴里的网木蜘蛛。",
    ["I'll leave it to you to get Tazan's satchel open, and return to me with its contents. The locking mechanism is complex, so it would probably be easiest if you obtained the key."] = "塔赞的挎包就交给你去打开了，把里面的东西带回来给我。锁的结构很复杂，所以拿到钥匙大概是最省事的办法。",
    ["The prized tunic of the Zandalar madcap is no exception, exuding the raw power of chaos and madness that they are able to channel."] = "赞达拉疯子那件珍贵的外套也不例外，散发着他们所能引导的混乱与疯狂的原始力量。",
    ["One of Zandalar's legendary madcaps was Khar'vaxal the Cracked."] = "赞达拉传说中的疯子之一，是“疯癫者”卡尔瓦克萨。",
    ["The madcaps of Zandalar are similar to rogues, but above all else they embrace madness..."] = "赞达拉的疯子和潜行者有些相似，但他们最重要的是拥抱疯狂……",
    ["The Soulflayer, a blood god the Atal'ai priests summoned into Zul'Gurub. He feeds on the blood of his own worshippers, which is the part they had not planned for."] = "灵魂掠夺者是阿塔莱祭司召唤到祖尔格拉布的血神。他以自己信徒的鲜血为食，而这是他们没有料到的。",
    ["The most powerful qiraji wield items of such might, they'd give pause even to a dragon. Bring me the qiraji bindings of command and other minor components by and I'll create a set of powerful boots for you."] = "最强大的其拉所用的物品拥有如此威力，连巨龙也会为之迟疑。把其拉的统御束缚和其他次要材料带给我，我会为你制作一双强力的靴子。",
    ["If you want Bonescythe made, you're going to have to supply the materials."] = "如果你想让白骨之镰被制造出来，就得由你来提供材料。",
    ["Death Knight Darkreaver lords over the Great Ossuary in the Scholomance. He threatens to twist the spirit realm to do his own bidding, and he must be stopped!"] = "死亡骑士达基瑞尔统治着通灵学院的大藏骨堂。他威胁要扭曲灵魂世界来为他所用，必须阻止他！",
    ["The augurs of the Zandalar all wear a distinctive chest piece called a hauberk."] = "赞达拉的占卜师都穿着一种独特的胸甲，叫做锁甲。",
    ["Bring me an offerin' of the Paragons of Power from inside Zul'Gurub and prove your worth to us. Do it and I'll give ya a belt that our augurs use - one with powerful mojo inside it!"] = "把祖尔格拉布里的力量典范当作祭品带给我，向我们证明你的价值。做到了，我就给你一条我们占卜师用的腰带——里面有强大的魔力！",
    ["They ain't a witch doctor; they spend their time castin' bones or readin' the leaves for insight - not hexin' people. As a shaman, you already know somethin' about the power of augury; we Zandalar prize the insight they give to the tribe."] = "他们不是巫医；他们把时间花在掷骨头或读叶子来获取洞察，而不是给人下咒。作为萨满，你已经对占卜的力量有所了解；我们赞达拉人珍视他们给部族带来的洞察。",
    ["Hail! I can tell by your demeanor that you've seen and done much in this world. Yet I'm willing to wager you haven't seen a piece of armor like this."] = "你好！从你的举止我就看得出，你在这个世界上见过很多、做过很多。不过我敢打赌，你没见过这样的护甲。",
    ["Valthalak's soul was stored in this amulet. In our greed we foolishly split it into three parts, not knowing the curse that would await us. The only way to stop Valthalak's spell is to put the amulet back together."] = "瓦尔萨拉克的灵魂被封存在这个护身符里。出于贪婪，我们愚蠢地把它分成了三部分，却不知道等待我们的诅咒。阻止瓦尔萨拉克法术的唯一办法，就是把护身符重新拼合起来。",
    ["A truly amazing story! You have my thanks, and the heartfelt gratitude of all who were involved, I can assure you. Through your efforts we are delivered from the mistakes of our past."] = "真是个了不起的故事！我向你致谢，我向你保证，所有相关的人也都会衷心感谢你。多亏了你的努力，我们摆脱了过去的错误。",
    ["You've proven to be a very reliable individual. As much as I trust that you'll help me through this predicament, it would be wise of me to reward you according to your performance."] = "你已证明自己是个非常可靠的人。虽然我相信你会帮我渡过这个难关，但按你的表现给予奖赏才是明智之举。",
    ["For now I will exchange your belt and gauntlets."] = "现在我先把你的腰带和护手换掉。",
    ["Bring me the remnants of the fallen along with purification materials and Earthshatter shall be yours to don."] = "把倒下之人的遗骸连同净化材料带给我，碎地者就是你的了。",
    ["Thanks to you and Omarion, may he rest in peace, I am now able to create Glacial gloves."] = "多亏了你和欧玛里恩，愿他安息，我现在能制作冰川手套了。",
    ["I hear Lord Wishock enjoyed his beverage. You have served us well. The Warlocks of Stormwind will be able to practice our ways without disturbance, thanks to you."] = "我听说维肖克勋爵很喜欢他的饮料。你为我们效力良多。多亏了你，暴风城的术士们将能不受打扰地修行我们的道路。",
    ["Even fragmented, they still possess the powers of the demons trapped inside. The orb of Soran'ruk was broken into two pieces, one was further broken to be used by the acolytes of the Twilight's Hammer in Blackfathom Deeps."] = "即使碎裂了，它们仍然拥有被困在里面的恶魔的力量。索兰鲁克之球被分成了两块，其中一块又被进一步打碎，供黑暗深渊里的暮光之锤侍僧使用。",
    ["I will put the robe together for you now. It will take but a few moments. Do not go far."] = "我现在就为你把长袍拼起来。只需要一会儿，别走远了。",
    ["I will get started immediately on crafting your orb and infusing your new demon into it. When done, you will have the choice of having it in the form of a staff or orb."] = "我会立刻开始制作你的法球，并把你的新恶魔灌注进去。完成后，你可以选择把它做成法杖或法球的形态。",
    ["I am the only survivor from our caravan attack by the centaur! A rare yet mighty panther is guarding my best gizmo, which is around his neck."] = "我是我们商队遭半人马袭击后唯一的幸存者！一头稀有但强大的猎豹守着我最好的小玩意儿，就挂在它的脖子上。",
    ["The prison is ready. Now for the most difficult portion of this task. You must find and capture a Doomguard Commander within the Tainted Scar using this crystal prison."] = "监牢已经准备好了。现在是这项任务最困难的部分。你必须使用这个水晶监牢，在污染之痕里找到并捕获一名末日守卫指挥官。",
    ["Kroshius lays in a heap to the northeast, in the Shatter Scar Vale. Take this Fel fire and use it on his remains. The fire should reanimate the fallen infernal."] = "克罗休斯瘫倒在东北方的碎痕谷里。拿上这团邪能之火，用在他的遗骸上。这火应该能让倒下的地狱火重新活过来。",
    ["Warlocks tread dangerous ground in dealing with demons, but our demoniacs take this one step further. Through an ancient and arcane ritual, they allow a demon to enter their being."] = "术士与恶魔打交道，是在危险的地带行走，但我们的恶魔使徒又更进一步。通过一场古老而神秘的仪式，他们让恶魔进入自己的身体。",
    ["The demoniac seeks to embody power outright, not just possess it."] = "恶魔使徒追求的是直接化身为力量，而不仅仅是拥有它。",
    ["The ultimate symbol of power amongst the tribe is the garb we wear in battle. A demoniac's robes have fused fine runecloth and devastatingly powerful mojo into a single fabric."] = "部族中力量的终极象征，就是我们在战斗中穿的服装。恶魔使徒的长袍把上等符文布和威力惊人的魔力融成了一块织物。",
    ["My pet is almost done. Now I just need something to stuff it with. Only the voodoo feathers from the trolls in the sunken temple will do. They go by the names Gasher, Mijan, Zolo, Hukku, Zul'lor, and Loro."] = "我的宠物快做好了。现在我只需要一些东西来填充它。只有沉没的神庙里那些巨魔的巫毒羽毛才行。它们叫做加舍、米詹、佐罗、胡库、祖洛和洛罗。",
    ["I make no pretenses, maggot. The darkness Plagueheart items hold could very well destroy the both of us."] = "我不装模作样，蛆虫。瘟疫之心物品所蕴含的黑暗，很可能把我们两个都毁掉。",
    ["Hey. Be careful 'round here. There be Dark Iron dwarves all around--looked like the Shadowforge clan. They just attacked the excavation site I was workin' at--killed nearly everyone there, including my boss Hammertoe."] = "嘿。在这附近要小心。到处都是黑铁矮人——看起来是影炉氏族。他们刚袭击了我工作的挖掘场——几乎杀光了那里所有人，包括我的老板锤趾。",
    ["Talk to my friend, Furen Longbeard, in the Dwarven District of Stormwind. He's the best shieldsmith you'll ever meet, and he owes me a big favor."] = "去暴风城矮人区找我的朋友弗伦·长须。他是你能遇到的最好的盾匠，而且他欠我一个大人情。",
    ["The Whirlwind Axe comes from an elemental trial a warrior has to complete alone. Three weapons come from the same chain and you keep only one."] = "旋风斧来自战士必须独自完成的元素试炼。同一条任务链会给出三件武器，你只能留下一件。",
    ["One of three weapons from the same solitary warrior trial. Choosing it means giving up the axe and the staff for good."] = "同一场战士独自试炼给出的三件武器之一。选择它，就意味着永远放弃那把斧头和那根法杖。",
    ["Burlguard sent you, did he? Yes, I have spare weapons around here, but first I have a task for you... A while ago a Defias villain Dead-tooth Jack tricked me."] = "是伯尔加德派你来的，对吧？没错，我这儿有备用武器，不过首先我有件事要你做……不久前，迪菲亚恶棍死牙杰克骗了我。",
    ["To pass this trial, you must travel south to the Field of Giants. There you will find a host of crawling, insect creatures. They are new to the Barrens and I do not like what they herald."] = "要通过这场试炼，你必须向南前往巨人之田。在那里你会发现一大群爬行的昆虫类生物。它们是贫瘠之地的新来者，我不喜欢它们所预示的东西。",
    ["I will give you a weapon, but first you must aid me. The Razormanes to the northwest came into my camp a few nights past."] = "我会给你一件武器，但你得先帮我。西北边的钢鬃野猪人几个晚上前闯进了我的营地。",
    ["A crafted helm that outlived several tiers of raid gear. Its plans were the thing guilds actually fought over."] = "一顶制作而成的头盔，比好几个档次的团队装备活得还久。公会真正争夺的是它的图纸。",
    ["Son of Blackhand and the last warchief of the Dark Horde, still holding Blackrock Spire long after the rest of the Horde moved on."] = "黑手之子，黑暗部落的最后一位大酋长，在其余部落早已离去之后，仍长久守着黑石塔。",
    ["The vindicator's symbol of power is the breastplate."] = "守备者的力量象征是胸甲。",
    ["Wreak havoc on the minions of evil. Zul'Gurub must taste Zandalar vengeance."] = "对邪恶的爪牙大肆破坏吧。祖尔格拉布必须尝到赞达拉的复仇。",
    ["Vengeance is power. The Zandalar vindicator is such power."] = "复仇即是力量。赞达拉的守备者就是这样的力量。",
    ["A stone giant pressed into qiraji service, who drains the mana of everyone fighting him and turns to rock when full."] = "一个被迫为其拉效力的石巨人，会吸干所有与他战斗之人的法力，吸满后就变成岩石。",
    ["During your battles with the Scourge in Naxxramas, should you come across desecrated battlements and wartorn plate scraps, return them to me and I shall craft for you a piece of armor worn by heroes."] = "在你于纳克萨玛斯与天灾军团交战期间，如果遇到被亵渎的城垛和战争摧残的板甲碎片，就带回来给我，我会为你制作一件英雄所穿的护甲。",
}) do text[k] = v end
